#: ../developer/operations.md:3
msgid ""
"This runbook is organized by task, so you can read only the section you "
"need. It covers provisioning hosts, deploying Cloud Agent, protecting "
"retained workspaces, and diagnosing job and network failures."
msgstr "本手册按任务组织，只读你需要的那一节即可。内容涵盖主机准备、Cloud Agent 部署、保留工作区的保护，以及任务和网络故障的诊断。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:7
msgid ""
"The control plane owns the job API, the database, accounts and admission,"
" the MCP, GitHub and model relays, and the admin settings. Every turn "
"runs on a model connection: either one its owner added with their own "
"provider key, or one the deployment provides through the model relay."
msgstr ""
"控制平面负责任务 API、数据库、账号与准入、MCP、GitHub "
"和模型中继，以及管理设置。每一轮都运行在某个模型连接上：要么是所有者用自己的服务商密钥添加的连接，要么是部署通过模型中继提供的连接。"

