"[compute-resource runbook](operations-compute.md) covers administrator-"
"managed SSH and CloudLab hosts. For pre-drain checks, migration "
"regression, failed peers, and queue alerts, use [deployment reliability"
"](deployment-reliability.md). Replace every `<...>` placeholder before "
"running a command."
msgstr ""
"配置项都写在 [ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md) 里；管理员管理的 SSH 主机和 CloudLab "
