"](deployment-reliability.md)。运行命令之前，先把所有 `<...>` 占位符替换掉。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:44
msgid "Admin Settings"
msgstr "Admin Settings"

#: ../developer/operations.md:46
msgid ""
"**Admin → Settings** holds the application and integration configuration,"
" web appearance, operational intervals, upload and skill limits, task "
"titles, sandbox and workspace limits, and sandbox archives, stored in the"
" Agent database. It is operator access: grant `agent.admin` only to "
"people you trust to operate the deployment, because it edits the host "
"signing key, the account settings (sign-up, approval, mail transport, "
"administrator addresses) and the GitHub API URL that GitHub credentials "
"are sent to. Saved credentials stay write-only."
msgstr ""
"**Admin → Settings** 保存应用与集成配置、Web "
"外观、运维间隔、上传与技能限制、任务标题、沙箱与工作区限制以及沙箱归档，这些都存放在 Agent 数据库中。它属于运维权限：只把 "
"`agent.admin` 授予你信任、可以运维这套部署的人，因为它能修改主机签名密钥、账号设置（注册、审批、邮件发送和管理员地址），以及 "
"GitHub 凭据所发往的 GitHub API URL。已保存的凭据始终只写不可读。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:54
msgid "Editing settings"
msgstr "编辑设置"

#: ../developer/operations.md:56
msgid ""
"A group is read-only until you choose **Edit**. Change the fields, select"
" **Review changes**, check the current and proposed values, then choose "
"**Apply changes**; **Cancel** discards the group's drafts, and unsaved "
"edits survive switching categories. A credential field shows only whether"
" a value is set: **Replace secret** (or **Set secret**) enters a new one,"
" and an empty replacement keeps the saved value. Each field's **More "
"actions** menu offers **Restore default…** or **Clear secret…**. The "
"**Administrator setup required** prompt links to required or partly "
"configured fields."
msgstr ""
"设置组在你点击 **Edit** 之前是只读的。修改字段后选择 **Review changes**，核对当前值与拟修改的值，再选择 "
"**Apply changes**；**Cancel** 会丢弃该组的草稿，切换分类不会丢失未保存的修改。凭据字段只显示是否已设置：用 "
"**Replace secret**（或 **Set secret**）输入新值，留空的替换会保留已保存的值。每个字段的 **More "
"actions** 菜单提供 **Restore default…** 或 **Clear secret…**。**Administrator "
"setup required** 提示会链接到必填或只配置了一部分的字段。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:65
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The API is `GET /admin/agent/settings` and `PUT /admin/agent/settings` "
"with a partial body such as `{\"settings\": {\"max_attempts\": 3}}`. Add "
"`\"expected_revision\"` with the `revision` you read to have the write "
"refused with 409 if someone saved in the meantime; the editor always "
"sends it. Writes appear in the Audit log."
msgstr ""
"API 是 `GET /admin/agent/settings` 和 `PUT "
"/admin/agent/settings`，请求体可以只含部分字段，例如 `{\"settings\": {\"max_attempts\": "
"3}}`。带上 `\"expected_revision\"` 并填入你读到的 `revision`，如果期间有人保存过，这次写入会以 409 "
"被拒绝；编辑器总会带上它。写入记录在审计日志中。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:71
msgid ""
"Listeners pick up saved changes every five seconds, and each setting's "
"description says when a change takes effect. The web server reads the "
"public appearance on every request, within 400 ms; when that fails, it "
"uses the last appearance it read, or neutral defaults before its first "
"successful read."
msgstr ""
"各监听进程每五秒同步一次已保存的修改，每项设置的说明里写明修改何时生效。Web 服务器在每个请求上读取公开外观，时限 400 "
"ms；读取失败时使用它上次读到的外观，首次成功读取之前则使用中性的默认值。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:76
msgid "Settings during an upgrade"
msgstr "升级时的设置"

#: ../developer/operations.md:78
msgid ""
"Apply migrations first ([upgrade notes](upgrade-notes.md)), then start "
"the main control-plane listener with its full environment. It imports the"
" registered environment settings once, and settings a new release adds "
"only when they are absent, never overwriting a saved value; the MCP-only "
"listener waits for that import. After that, `.env` values no longer "
"matter, and resetting a field never brings one back."
msgstr ""
"先执行迁移（见[升级说明](upgrade-"
"notes.md)），再用完整的环境启动主控制平面监听进程。它会把已注册的环境设置导入一次，新版本新增的设置也只在不存在时导入，绝不覆盖已保存的值；仅"
" MCP 监听进程会等待导入完成。此后 `.env` 中的值不再起作用，重置字段也不会把旧值带回来。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:85
msgid ""
"The import refuses an `AGENT_CONTROL_TOKEN_SECRET` or "
"`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY` shorter than 32 bytes, an "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_INSTALL_URL` that is not an `https://github.com` URL, "
"and an `AGENT_GITLAB_OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI` that is not HTTPS (HTTP on "
"localhost is allowed). The listener stops with an error naming the "
"variable before anything is written, so rolling back is safe. Replacing "
"the control key means re-enrolling hosts, and a new encryption key "
"orphans saved user connections."
msgstr ""
"导入会拒绝短于 32 字节的 `AGENT_CONTROL_TOKEN_SECRET` 或 "
"`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`、不是 `https://github.com` URL 的 "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_INSTALL_URL`，以及不是 HTTPS 的 "
"`AGENT_GITLAB_OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI`（localhost 上允许 "
"HTTP）。监听进程会在写入任何内容之前报错退出并指出变量名，因此可以安全回滚。更换控制密钥意味着要重新注册主机，更换加密密钥则会让已保存的用户连接失效。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:93
msgid ""
"When a release narrows what a setting accepts, a saved value it refuses "
"does not stop the listeners. Each logs `saved setting not applied as "
"stored: …` once per settings revision, naming the key but never the "
"value, and uses the built-in default. A signing key, encryption key or "
"service token below a new minimum length stays in use until you replace "
"it. Save a valid value or confirm **Restore default** to clear the "
"warning. Stored credentials that cannot be decrypted, or are not "
"encrypted, still stop the listener."
msgstr ""
"新版本收紧某项设置的取值范围时，被拒绝的已保存值不会让监听进程停下。每个监听进程会在每个设置修订版记录一次 `saved setting not "
"applied as stored: "
"…`，只写键名、不写值，并改用内置默认值。签名密钥、加密密钥或服务令牌即使短于新的最小长度，也会继续使用，直到你替换它。保存一个合法的值，或确认 "
"**Restore default**，即可消除这条警告。无法解密或未加密的已存凭据仍会让监听进程停止。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:101
msgid "A new installation"
msgstr "全新安装"

#: ../developer/operations.md:103
msgid ""
"A new installation needs no `.env`. Start the web application before you "
"enroll hosts or run the deployment readiness gate. From the deployment "
"checkout:"
msgstr "全新安装不需要 `.env`。先启动 Web 应用，再注册主机或运行部署就绪检查。在部署检出目录中执行："

#: ../developer/operations.md:112
msgid ""
"The browser reaches the web app and the API on one origin, with the API "
"at `/api`. The `edge` profile is the nginx that splits that origin, on "
"`127.0.0.1:3003` (`AGENT_EDGE_BIND`, `AGENT_EDGE_PORT`); point the TLS "
"proxy or tunnel in front of the hostname at it. Leave the profile out "
"only when that proxy already routes `/api/*` to the control plane with "
"the prefix stripped, and everything else to the web app."
msgstr ""
"浏览器在同一个源下访问 Web 应用和 API，API 位于 `/api`。`edge` profile 就是拆分这个源的 nginx，监听 "
"`127.0.0.1:3003`（`AGENT_EDGE_BIND`、`AGENT_EDGE_PORT`）；把主机名前面的 TLS "
"代理或隧道指向它。只有当那个代理已经把 `/api/*` 去掉前缀后转发给控制平面、并把其余请求转给 Web 应用时，才可以不启用这个 "
"profile。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:119
msgid ""
"On the bundled database, the `keys` service generates the database "
"password, `AGENT_DATABASE_URL`, `AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET` and "
"`AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY` into the `agent-keys` volume before "
"anything else starts ([how the keys are kept](../../ENVIRONMENT.md"
"#settings-and-bootstrap-configuration)); an artifact deployment's first "
"`prepare` does the same ([release "
"artifacts](../../deploy/release/README.md)). For another database, set "
"those three yourself in the environment or a `.env` beside it, because "
"the `keys` service cannot prove such a database is new. It stores what it"
" is given, so you can delete the lines after one start. Back the keys up "
"apart from the database ([Disaster recovery](disaster-recovery.md)): the "
"settings root key decrypts every saved secret."
msgstr ""
"使用内置数据库时，`keys` "
"服务会在其他服务启动前生成数据库密码、`AGENT_DATABASE_URL`、`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET` 和 "
"`AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY`，存进 `agent-keys` "
"卷（[密钥如何保存](../../ENVIRONMENT.md#settings-and-bootstrap-"
"configuration)）；制品部署的第一次 `prepare` "
"也会这样做（[发布制品](../../deploy/release/README.md)）。使用其他数据库时，请自己在环境或旁边的 `.env` "
"中设置这三项，因为 `keys` "
"服务无法确认那个数据库是新的。它会保存收到的值，所以启动一次之后就可以删掉这几行。务必把这些密钥与数据库分开备份（[灾难恢复](disaster-"
"recovery.md)）：设置根密钥能解密每一个已保存的秘密。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:131
msgid ""
"On its first start, the control plane generates its host signing key, "
"credential encryption keys and sandbox manager credential, and logs a "
"one-time setup code (`agent_local_setup_pending`). Then:"
msgstr ""
"控制平面首次启动时会生成主机签名密钥、凭据加密密钥和 Sandbox Manager "
"凭据，并在日志中输出一次性设置码（`agent_local_setup_pending`）。然后："

#: ../developer/operations.md:135
msgid ""
"Open `/setup/administrator`, enter the code and create the first "
"administrator."
msgstr "打开 `/setup/administrator`，输入设置码，创建第一个管理员。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:137
msgid "Confirm the site address the page offers; account emails link to it."
msgstr "确认页面给出的站点地址；账号邮件中的链接都指向它。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:138
msgid ""
"On **Admin → Servers**, add the first server with **Add server**, which "
"writes the host's configuration ([Compute resources](operations-"
"compute.md))."
msgstr ""
"在 **Admin → Servers** 中用 **Add server** 添加第一台服务器，它会写入该主机的配置（[计算资源"
"](operations-compute.md)）。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:140
msgid "Run the usual deployment command."
msgstr "运行常规的部署命令。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:142
msgid "Recovery access and the settings root key"
msgstr "恢复入口与设置根密钥"

#: ../developer/operations.md:144
msgid ""
"`/setup` is the recovery door for when no administrator can sign in. It "
"works only when the deployment sets `ADMIN_TOKEN`, goes through the "
"ordinary administrator API and audit trail, and keeps the token only in "
"page memory."
msgstr ""
"`/setup` 是所有管理员都无法登录时的恢复入口。只有部署设置了 `ADMIN_TOKEN` 时它才可用；它走普通的管理员 API "
"和审计记录，令牌只保存在页面内存中。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:148
msgid ""
"An older installation may still use `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` as the "
"settings root. Before removing it, set `AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY` to"
" the **same value** on both listeners, and back it up apart from the "
"database. Changing the root key needs the stored settings re-encrypted "
"and a coordinated listener rollout; replacing the environment value alone"
" makes existing ciphertext unreadable. The API refuses to replace or "
"reset an existing credential encryption key without a separate re-"
"encryption procedure."
msgstr ""
"较早的安装可能仍以 `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` 作为设置根密钥。删除它之前，先在两个监听进程上把 "
"`AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY` "
"设为**同一个值**，并与数据库分开备份。更换根密钥需要重新加密已存设置，并协调各监听进程的发布；只替换环境变量会让现有密文无法读取。没有单独的重新加密流程时，API"
" 会拒绝替换或重置已有的凭据加密密钥。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:156
msgid ""
"Database access, the settings encryption root, recovery authentication, "
"host provisioning, networking and listeners, host isolation, build "
"routing, mounted files and trusted compute deployment profiles stay "
"deployment configuration. Admin Settings lists them with their values "
"hidden ([environment inventory](../../ENVIRONMENT.md#settings-and-"
"bootstrap-configuration))."
msgstr ""
"数据库访问、设置加密根密钥、恢复认证、主机准备、网络与监听、主机隔离、构建路由、挂载文件以及受信任的计算部署配置仍属于部署配置。Admin "
"Settings 会列出它们，但隐藏其值（[环境清单](../../ENVIRONMENT.md#settings-and-bootstrap-"
"configuration)）。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:162
msgid "Sandbox archive storage"
msgstr "沙箱归档存储"

#: ../developer/operations.md:164
msgid ""
"**Archive to S3 and delete** writes to the bucket and region of the "
"**Sandbox archives** policy ([Sandbox archives](#sandbox-archives)), so "
"it is available only while that policy is enabled. While it is disabled, "
"an administrator can only discard a sandbox, and a deleted chat's sandbox"
" is retired without an archive. Each request writes one object, "
"`s3://<bucket>/cloud-"
"agent/sandbox/deletion/<sandbox>/<request>/archive.tar`."
msgstr ""
"**Archive to S3 and delete** 写入 **Sandbox archives** 策略的存储桶和区域（[沙箱归档"
"](#sandbox-"
"archives)），因此只有在该策略启用时才可用。策略关闭时，管理员只能丢弃沙箱，已删除对话的沙箱会不经归档直接退役。每个请求写入一个对象：`s3://<bucket"
">/cloud-agent/sandbox/deletion/<sandbox>/<request>/archive.tar`。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:171
msgid ""
"The control plane signs and verifies the upload with the policy's saved "
"access key or, without one, its standard AWS SDK credential chain, "
"preferably an IAM workload role. That identity needs `s3:PutObject` and "
"`s3:GetObject` on `arn:aws:s3:::<bucket>/cloud-agent/sandbox/deletion/*` "
"(the lifecycle grant on `cloud-agent/sandbox/*` already includes both), "
"plus `kms:GenerateDataKey` and `kms:Decrypt` on the key if the bucket "
"applies SSE-KMS by default. It does not need `s3:DeleteObject`. A "
"policy's expected bucket owner is asserted on the `HeadObject`."
msgstr ""
"控制平面用策略中保存的访问密钥签名并校验上传；没有保存密钥时，使用它的标准 AWS SDK 凭据链，最好是 IAM 工作负载角色。这个身份需要 "
"`arn:aws:s3:::<bucket>/cloud-agent/sandbox/deletion/*` 上的 `s3:PutObject` "
"和 `s3:GetObject`（`cloud-agent/sandbox/*` 上的生命周期授权已包含这两项）；如果存储桶默认使用 SSE-"
"KMS，还需要该密钥上的 `kms:GenerateDataKey` 和 `kms:Decrypt`。它不需要 "
"`s3:DeleteObject`。策略设置了预期的存储桶所有者时，会在 `HeadObject` 上校验。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:180
msgid ""
"For environment or shared-profile credentials, create a private Compose "
"override for the main service; the base Compose forwards no AWS "
"variables. For example:"
msgstr "要使用环境变量或共享配置文件中的凭据，请为主服务创建一个私有的 Compose 覆盖文件；基础 Compose 不会传递任何 AWS 变量。例如："

#: ../developer/operations.md:192
msgid ""
"Keep the override outside the checkout and set its absolute path as "
"`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_COMPOSE_OVERRIDE_FILE` in the deployment root's "
"`.env`; the deployer applies it after the release's own overlays, in "
"source and artifact modes. For shared profiles, mount the files read-only"
" and set `AWS_SHARED_CREDENTIALS_FILE`, `AWS_CONFIG_FILE` and "
"`AWS_PROFILE`. Neither path gives AWS credentials to sandboxes, the web "
"app or the MCP relay."
msgstr ""
"覆盖文件放在检出目录之外，并在部署根目录的 `.env` 中把它的绝对路径设为 "
"`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_COMPOSE_OVERRIDE_FILE`；部署脚本在源码模式和制品模式下都会在发布自带的覆盖层之后应用它。使用共享配置文件时，把这些文件只读挂载，并设置"
" `AWS_SHARED_CREDENTIALS_FILE`、`AWS_CONFIG_FILE` 和 `AWS_PROFILE`。两种方式都不会把"
" AWS 凭据交给沙箱、Web 应用或 MCP 中继。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:199
msgid ""
"The host gets a 15-minute presigned PUT with a fixed byte length, a full-"
"object SHA-256 and `If-None-Match: *`. An archive over **5 GiB** is "
"refused and the container kept, and a retry after a successful upload can"
" get HTTP 412. Before deleting, the control plane reads `HeadObject` with"
" `ChecksumMode=ENABLED` and requires the exact SHA-256 and length that S3"
" verified; ETags and supplied metadata do not count."
msgstr ""
"主机拿到一个 15 分钟有效的预签名 PUT，带固定的字节长度、整个对象的 SHA-256 和 `If-None-Match: *`。超过 **5"
" GiB** 的归档会被拒绝，容器保留；上传成功后再重试可能得到 HTTP 412。删除之前，控制平面用 "
"`ChecksumMode=ENABLED` 读取 `HeadObject`，要求 SHA-256 和长度与 S3 校验过的完全一致；ETag "
"和上传方提供的元数据都不算数。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:206
msgid ""
"Use a private bucket with public access blocked, encryption, retention "
"and recovery access. Other principals must keep the objects immutable "
"too: a bucket policy can require conditional writes, and versioning or "
"Object Lock protect further. Do not expire an archive that a deletion or "
"recovery may still need. The receipt records the original S3 URI, "
"SHA-256, length and version, so changing the bucket does not redirect "
"verification of an existing request."
msgstr ""
"使用私有存储桶，屏蔽公开访问，并配置加密、保留期和恢复访问权限。其他主体也必须保持对象不可变：存储桶策略可以强制条件写入，版本控制或 Object"
" Lock 能提供更强的保护。删除或恢复可能还需要的归档，不要让它过期。回执记录了原始 S3 "
"URI、SHA-256、长度和版本，因此更换存储桶不会改变已有请求的校验目标。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:213
msgid "Database browser"
msgstr "数据库浏览器"

#: ../developer/operations.md:215
msgid ""
"**Admin → Database** browses the Agent database in the dashboard: select "
"a table, add filters (combined with AND; Contains matches a literal, "
"case-insensitive substring), choose a sort column and page size, then "
"select **Run query**. It shows only reviewed metadata columns, never "
"stored credentials, raw user content or opaque configuration documents. "
"Queries are read-only, parameterized, bounded and time-limited, each "
"checks current `agent.admin`, and outcomes appear under **Audit log → "
"Database** without filter values or returned data. The API is `GET "
"/admin/agent/database/tables` and `POST /admin/agent/database/query`. For"
" writes and arbitrary SQL, use pgAdmin."
msgstr ""
"**Admin → Database** 让你在仪表盘里浏览 Agent 数据库：选择一张表，添加过滤条件（多个条件按 AND "
"组合；Contains 匹配不区分大小写的字面子串），选择排序列和每页条数，然后选择 **Run "
"query**。它只显示经过审查的元数据列，从不显示已存凭据、原始用户内容或不透明的配置文档。查询是只读、参数化、有上限且有超时的，每次都会检查当前的"
" `agent.admin`，结果记录在 **Audit log → Database** 中，但不含过滤值和返回的数据。API 是 `GET "
"/admin/agent/database/tables` 和 `POST "
"/admin/agent/database/query`。需要写入或执行任意 SQL 时，请用 pgAdmin。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:225
msgid "pgAdmin"
msgstr "pgAdmin"

#: ../developer/operations.md:227
msgid ""
"**Admin → Database → Open pgAdmin** opens pgAdmin through the same-origin"
" API proxy, so the public edge needs no new route. Every request needs "
"current `agent.admin`. pgAdmin keeps its own login and CSRF checks, and "
"Agent cookies and bearer credentials are never sent to it."
msgstr ""
"**Admin → Database → Open pgAdmin** 通过同源的 API 代理打开 "
"pgAdmin，所以公开入口不需要新增路由。每个请求都需要当前的 `agent.admin`。pgAdmin 保留自己的登录和 CSRF "
"检查，Agent 的 Cookie 和 bearer 凭据从不会发给它。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:232
msgid ""
"To enable it, add this to the control-plane deployment's `.env`, keeping "
"any existing profiles (for example `COMPOSE_PROFILES=edge,pgadmin`), and "
"run the normal deployment:"
msgstr ""
"要启用它，在控制平面部署的 `.env` 中加入以下内容，并保留已有的 profile（例如 "
"`COMPOSE_PROFILES=edge,pgadmin`），然后运行常规部署："

#: ../developer/operations.md:242
msgid ""
"On an existing stack, this starts the service and applies the new "
"control-plane environment (for an artifact deployment, use the release-"
"generated Compose file):"
msgstr "在已有的环境上，下面的命令会启动该服务并应用新的控制平面环境（制品部署请使用发布生成的 Compose 文件）："

#: ../developer/operations.md:249
msgid ""
"Then open **Admin → Database**, choose an administrator email and a "
"password of at least 12 characters, and wait for **Open pgAdmin**. Only a"
" current Agent administrator can complete setup, and no account or "
"default password is shipped. Setup saves the connection under **Admin → "
"Settings → Operations** (Database tools) if none is saved. The public URL"
" defaults to the web base URL plus `/api/admin/agent/pgadmin/`; for "
"another prefix, set `AGENT_PGADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_PUBLIC_URL` before setup. "
"Keep the `agent-pgadmin-bootstrap` and `agent-pgadmin` volumes across "
"deployments."
msgstr ""
"然后打开 **Admin → Database**，设定管理员邮箱和至少 12 个字符的密码，等待 **Open pgAdmin** "
"出现。只有当前的 Agent 管理员能完成设置，系统不附带任何账号或默认密码。如果还没有保存连接，设置会把它保存到 **Admin → "
"Settings → Operations**（Database tools）下。公开 URL 默认是 Web 基础 URL 加上 "
"`/api/admin/agent/pgadmin/`；如果前缀不同，请在设置前设置 "
"`AGENT_PGADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_PUBLIC_URL`。部署之间要保留 `agent-pgadmin-bootstrap` 和 "
"`agent-pgadmin` 两个卷。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:258
msgid ""
"Sign in with the email and password you chose. The server definition "
"points to `postgres:5432`, with the database and user named by "
"`AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` and `AGENT_POSTGRES_USER` (both `cloudagent` by "
"default); enter the database password when you connect. pgAdmin imports "
"that definition only once, so after changing either variable, edit the "
"connection in pgAdmin."
msgstr ""
"用你设定的邮箱和密码登录。服务器定义指向 `postgres:5432`，数据库和用户分别由 `AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` 和 "
"`AGENT_POSTGRES_USER` 指定（默认都是 `cloudagent`）；连接时输入数据库密码。pgAdmin "
"只导入一次这个定义，因此修改其中任一变量后，请在 pgAdmin 里编辑连接。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:264
msgid ""
"**Private pgAdmin URL** can only select a pgAdmin the deployment names: "
"the bundled `http://pgadmin:5050`, or the scheme, host and port of "
"`AGENT_PGADMIN_URL` or `AGENT_PGADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_URL` in the control "
"plane's environment. Any other saved URL gets 503 without being "
"contacted, because the proxy forwards every method, path and body and "
"could otherwise reach a cloud metadata endpoint or another private "
"service. To run pgAdmin elsewhere, set `AGENT_PGADMIN_URL`, restart the "
"control plane, select the same address, and keep the variable set."
msgstr ""
"**Private pgAdmin URL** 只能选择部署指定的 pgAdmin：内置的 "
"`http://pgadmin:5050`，或控制平面环境中 "
"`AGENT_PGADMIN_URL`、`AGENT_PGADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_URL` 的协议、主机和端口。保存其他 URL "
"时，系统会直接返回 503，而不会连接它，因为代理会转发任意方法、路径和请求体，否则就可能访问云元数据端点或其他内网服务。要在别处运行 "
"pgAdmin，请设置 `AGENT_PGADMIN_URL`，重启控制平面，选择同一地址，并保持该变量一直设置。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:273
msgid ""
"**Security.** pgAdmin runs on the Agent's origin, where the "
"administrator's session authorizes every admin route. The proxy therefore"
" adds a second `Content-Security-Policy` that keeps pgAdmin's fetches, "
"forms, frames and workers under its own path, plus `frame-ancestors "
"'self'`, `nosniff`, `X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN` and `Cross-Origin-"
"Opener-Policy: same-origin`. This narrows what an injected script could "
"do, but it is not an origin boundary: pgAdmin shares the origin's browser"
" storage, and only a separate origin would remove the shared session, "
"which this release does not provide. Keep the pinned image and its "
"default security headers, enable the profile only where it is used, and "
"grant `agent.admin` only to operators. pgAdmin connects as the database "
"owner, and the Agent audit log records no SQL (only "
"`agent.database.pgadmin.setup` and `agent.database.pgadmin.open`), so "
"treat pgAdmin access as full database access."
msgstr ""
"**安全**。pgAdmin 运行在 Agent 的源上，而管理员会话在这个源上能授权所有管理路由。因此代理额外加了一条 `Content-"
"Security-Policy`，把 pgAdmin 的请求、表单、frame 和 worker 限制在它自己的路径下，另外还加上 `frame-"
"ancestors 'self'`、`nosniff`、`X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN` 和 `Cross-"
"Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin`。这能缩小注入脚本可做的事，但不是源边界：pgAdmin "
"与该源共享浏览器存储，只有独立的源才能去掉共享的会话，而本版本没有提供。在那之前，请保留固定版本的镜像及其默认安全头，只在需要的地方启用该 "
"profile，并且只把 `agent.admin` 授予运维人员。pgAdmin 以数据库所有者身份连接，而 Agent 审计日志不记录 "
"SQL（只记录 `agent.database.pgadmin.setup` 和 "
"`agent.database.pgadmin.open`），所以拥有 pgAdmin 访问权就等于拥有完整的数据库权限。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:287
msgid ""
"**Troubleshooting.** For the HTTP-only local stack, set "
"`AGENT_PGADMIN_COOKIE_SECURE=False`. If the dashboard reports pgAdmin "
"unavailable, check `docker compose logs pgadmin`. Before setup, the "
"container is healthy and logs `Waiting for first-time setup in Admin -> "
"Database.`; after setup, unreadable bootstrap storage or an unavailable "
"PostgreSQL stops it. A setup that cannot write the bootstrap volume is "
"recorded as failed: fix the volume and set up again. To turn access off, "
"reset **Private pgAdmin URL**; removing the profile keeps the volume."
msgstr ""
"**故障排查**。在仅 HTTP 的本地环境中，设置 `AGENT_PGADMIN_COOKIE_SECURE=False`。如果仪表盘显示 "
"pgAdmin 不可用，查看 `docker compose logs pgadmin`。设置完成之前，容器是健康的，并输出 `Waiting "
"for first-time setup in Admin -> Database.`；设置完成之后，引导存储不可读或 PostgreSQL "
"不可用都会让它无法启动。无法写入引导卷的设置会被记录为失败：修好卷后重新设置即可。要关闭访问，重置 **Private pgAdmin "
"URL**；移除该 profile 会保留它的卷。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:296
msgid "What a job does"
msgstr "一个任务会做什么"

#: ../developer/operations.md:309
msgid ""
"The platform never pushes or opens a pull request itself. When the owner "
"asks, the agent does, as the owner, through the [GitHub relay](#the-"
"github-relay), and the pull requests it opens are recorded for the "
"conversation ([Resume, Fork, and pull requests](#resume-fork-and-pull-"
"requests)). **Watch PR and merge** asks the agent to merge once required "
"checks and reviews pass; the repository's GitHub rules decide what may "
"merge without a person."
msgstr ""
"平台自己从不推送，也从不创建拉取请求。所有者要求时，由 agent 以所有者的身份通过 [GitHub 中继](#the-github-"
"relay)完成，它创建的拉取请求会记录在该对话下（[续接、Fork 与拉取请求](#resume-fork-and-pull-"
"requests)）。**Watch PR and merge** 让 agent "
"在必需的检查和审查通过后合并；哪些改动可以无人参与就合并，由仓库的 GitHub 规则决定。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:316
msgid "Credential boundaries:"
msgstr "凭据边界："

#: ../developer/operations.md:318
msgid ""
"**No repository credential enters the sandbox.** The owner's GitHub token"
" stays in the control plane for the GitHub relay. The runner's clone "
"credential is read-only, scoped to one repository and never written to "
"`.git/config` (it travels in git's environment), and the runner refuses "
"to start the agent if it finds the token anywhere under `.git/`."
msgstr ""
"**沙箱里不放任何仓库凭据**。所有者的 GitHub 令牌留在控制平面，供 GitHub 中继使用。runner "
"的克隆凭据是只读的，只限一个仓库，从不写入 `.git/config`（它放在 git 的环境变量里传递）；如果在 `.git/` "
"下任何位置发现该令牌，runner 会拒绝启动 agent。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:323
msgid ""
"**git and `gh` act as the owner without the owner's token.** A member's "
"`GH_TOKEN` is its residency's placeholder, which only the GitHub relay "
"accepts."
msgstr ""
"**git 和 `gh` 以所有者身份操作，但不持有所有者的令牌**。成员的 `GH_TOKEN` 是其 residency 的占位符，只有 "
"GitHub 中继接受它。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:325
msgid ""
"**Model and MCP credentials are narrow.** The CLI runs on the owner's "
"provider key, handed over only in that owner's claim and residency, or, "
"on a provided model, holds only a placeholder that the model relay "
"accepts. A separate attempt-fenced `mcp` token reaches only the MCP relay"
" and the servers the conversation's bindings authorize. Neither can write"
" the event log or end the job; only the runner's token can."
msgstr ""
"**模型和 MCP 凭据都只有最小权限**。CLI 使用所有者的服务商密钥运行，这个密钥只在该所有者的认领和 residency "
"中交给主机；使用部署提供的模型时，CLI 只持有模型中继接受的占位符。另有一个受 attempt 栅栏约束的 `mcp` 令牌，只能访问 MCP "
"中继，以及对话绑定所授权的服务器。两者都不能写事件日志，也不能结束任务；只有 runner 的令牌可以。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:331
msgid ""
"**There is no per-job spend cap and no local quota.** The provider keeps "
"the key's quota and bill."
msgstr "**没有按任务的花费上限，也没有本地配额**。密钥的配额和账单都由服务商管理。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:334
msgid "Temporary workspaces"
msgstr "临时工作区"

#: ../developer/operations.md:336
msgid ""
"A job created with `\"repo\": null` starts a conversation without a "
"repository. Any user with `agent.use` may create one, and its claim "
"carries no clone or `GH_TOKEN` credential. The host makes `/workspace` a "
"new Git repository on `main` with one empty commit, the same on every "
"host (`77bbec2039abcd5c7663078db4f90f3c860a751a`), which becomes the "
"job's base. A request that also names `base_ref`, `base_sha` or "
"`environment_id` is refused. The GitHub relay sends the agent's requests "
"without credentials and records no pull request. Everything else "
"(archive, delete, Fork, Side Chat, goals, MCP, retention, checkpoints, S3"
" archiving) works as for a repository chat, but no project memory is "
"built. `temporary=true` on `GET /v1/agent/jobs`, `/conversations` and "
"`/sessions` lists only these conversations and cannot be combined with "
"`repo`. While a configured GitHub App cannot be loaded, creating one "
"answers `503`, like any job."
msgstr ""
"用 `\"repo\": null` 创建的任务会开启一个没有仓库的对话。任何拥有 `agent.use` "
"的用户都可以创建，它的认领不带克隆凭据或 `GH_TOKEN`。主机会把 `/workspace` 初始化为一个新的 Git 仓库，位于 "
"`main` "
"分支，只有一个空提交，在每台主机上都相同（`77bbec2039abcd5c7663078db4f90f3c860a751a`），这个提交就是任务的基线。同时指定"
" `base_ref`、`base_sha` 或 `environment_id` 的请求会被拒绝。GitHub 中继转发 agent "
"的请求时不附带任何凭据，也不记录拉取请求。其余功能（归档、删除、Fork、Side Chat、目标、MCP、保留、检查点、S3 "
"归档）都与仓库对话相同，只是不会生成项目记忆。在 `GET /v1/agent/jobs`、`/conversations` 和 "
"`/sessions` 上使用 `temporary=true` 只列出这类对话，且不能与 `repo` 同时使用。已配置的 GitHub App"
" 无法加载时，创建这类对话与创建其他任务一样会返回 `503`。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:350
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/agent/jobs/{job_id}/workspace/archive` downloads any retained "
"chat's `/workspace` as a gzipped tar. The host compresses it to disk "
"first, so a workspace over `workspace_download_max_mib` (default 1024 "
"MiB, before compression) is refused with `413` instead of arriving "
"truncated."
msgstr ""
"`GET /v1/agent/jobs/{job_id}/workspace/archive` 把任一保留对话的 `/workspace` "
"下载为一个 gzip 压缩的 tar 包。主机会先把它压缩到本地磁盘，因此超过 `workspace_download_max_mib`（默认 "
"1024 MiB，按压缩前计算）的工作区会以 `413` 被拒绝，而不会下载到一半被截断。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:355
msgid "Conversation titles"
msgstr "对话标题"

#: ../developer/operations.md:357
msgid ""
"A new conversation is titled with its prompt's first meaningful line, cut"
" to **Maximum task title length** (36 characters by default; under "
"Advanced on **Admin → Settings → Content**). The owner can rename it; "
"follow-ups keep the name, and forks inherit it. No model is asked for a "
"title."
msgstr ""
"新对话的标题取自提示词中第一行有意义的内容，截断到 **Maximum task title length**（默认 36 个字符；位于 "
"**Admin → Settings → Content** 的 Advanced 部分）。所有者可以重命名；后续消息沿用该名称，Fork "
"会继承它。标题不是由模型生成的。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:363
msgid "Conversation status and run history"
msgstr "对话状态和运行历史"

#: ../developer/operations.md:365
msgid ""
"The UI shows **Queued**, **Running**, **Idle** or **Failed**. A running "
"turn wins over queued ones; otherwise the latest turn decides, and "
"completed and user-stopped turns leave the conversation idle. The owner "
"API reports this as `conversation_state`, separate from the selected "
"job's `state`. A turn's execution history appears only when it had "
"several attempts, and viewing history never restarts or moves a task."
msgstr ""
"界面显示 **Queued**、**Running**、**Idle** 或 "
"**Failed**。只要有正在运行的轮次，就显示为运行中，优先于排队的轮次；否则由最新一轮决定，已完成或被用户停止的轮次都会让对话变为空闲。所有者"
" API 用 `conversation_state` 报告这个状态，它与所选任务的 `state` 相互独立。只有当某一轮有多次 attempt"
" 时才会显示其执行历史，查看历史永远不会重启任务或更换服务器。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:372
msgid "Native agent questions"
msgstr "agent 的原生提问"

#: ../developer/operations.md:374
msgid ""
"Claude Code `AskUserQuestion`, Codex user-input requests, and "
"OpenCode/Kilo questions open a dialog while the turn waits; submitting "
"continues the same native tool call. **Answer later** closes it, **Review"
" question** reopens it, and **Skip** declines. Claude Code `ExitPlanMode`"
" uses the same dialog: **Approve plan** lets Claude leave plan mode, and "
"**Skip** asks it to keep planning. Pending questions are read from the "
"resident agent, so a reload finds them again. An answer names the job, "
"attempt and request, both the API and the host fence it, and answers are "
"never queued as follow-ups."
msgstr ""
"Claude Code 的 `AskUserQuestion`、Codex 的用户输入请求以及 OpenCode/Kilo "
"的提问，会在该轮等待时弹出对话框；提交后会继续同一个原生工具调用。**Answer later** 关闭对话框，**Review "
"question** 重新打开它，**Skip** 表示拒绝。Claude Code 的 `ExitPlanMode` "
"使用同一个对话框：**Approve plan** 让 Claude 退出计划模式，**Skip** 让它继续规划。待回答的问题从常驻 agent"
" 读取，所以重新加载页面后仍能找到。回答会标明任务、attempt 和请求，API 和主机都会校验这一身份，回答也从不会作为后续消息排队。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:383
msgid ""
"Deploy the runner, Sandbox Manager and rebuilt sandbox image together. "
"The `http-agent-live-bridge` helper pin is `5` ([native conversation "
"recall](context-recall.md)); helper `2` and earlier cannot execute "
"question replies, and anything older than the pin fails the turn-time "
"attestation. Before starting a replacement OpenCode/Kilo process, the "
"host installs its trusted bridge into the retained container, keeping the"
" workspace and native sessions."
msgstr ""
"runner、Sandbox Manager 和重新构建的沙箱镜像要一起部署。`http-agent-live-bridge` "
"辅助程序的固定版本是 `5`（见[原生对话回忆](context-recall.md)）；辅助程序 `2` "
"及更早版本无法执行问题回复，低于固定版本的都无法通过轮次开始时的校验。启动替换用的 OpenCode/Kilo "
"进程之前，主机会把它受信任的桥接程序装进保留容器，工作区和原生会话保持不变。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:391
msgid "Who may run a job against which repository"
msgstr "谁能对哪个仓库运行任务"

#: ../developer/operations.md:393
msgid ""
"A repository needs at least one entitlement, the user's GitHub connection"
" or the deployment allowlist; job creation fails closed without one."
msgstr "一个仓库至少需要一项授权：用户的 GitHub 连接，或者部署的允许列表；两者都没有时，任务创建会直接拒绝。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:396
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**User connection.** The user authorizes the GitHub App through the "
"frontend callback. The control plane exchanges the code for a user token,"
" records the account in `agent_github_accounts`, and stores the "
"installations GitHub reports in `agent_repo_grants`; reconnecting removes"
" grants the user can no longer reach. The composer, job creation, claims "
"and workspace reads check repositories **as the user** through "
"`/user/installations/{id}/repositories`, and only repositories the user "
"can **push** to qualify. The answer is cached per user for **GitHub "
"repository cache duration** (60 seconds by default; under Advanced on "
"**Admin → Settings → Source control**). Do not replace this check with an"
" installation-token listing: GitHub can report an organization's "
"installation to a collaborator who can see only one of its repositories, "
"and the installation token would expose the rest."
msgstr ""
"**用户连接**。用户通过前端回调授权 GitHub App。控制平面用授权码换取用户令牌，把账号记录在 "
"`agent_github_accounts` 中，并把 GitHub 报告的安装记录到 "
"`agent_repo_grants`；重新连接会删除用户已无法访问的授权。输入框、任务创建、认领和工作区读取都会通过 "
"`/user/installations/{id}/repositories` "
"**以该用户身份**检查仓库，只有用户能**推送**的仓库才符合条件。结果按用户缓存，时长为 **GitHub repository cache "
"duration**（默认 60 秒；位于 **Admin → Settings → Source control** 的 Advanced "
"部分）。不要把这项检查换成安装令牌的仓库列表：GitHub 可能把某个组织的安装报告给只能看到其中一个仓库的协作者，而安装令牌会暴露其余仓库。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:409
msgid ""
"The user token stays in the control plane, encrypted with "
"`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`. GitHub App user tokens last eight "
"hours, with a six-month, single-use refresh token; refresh starts five "
"minutes before expiry under a row lease. A connection without a usable "
"token grants nothing, and the composer asks the user to **Connect "
"GitHub** again. Connecting and installing the App are separate steps: if "
"the App is not installed on the user's own account, the connect flow "
"offers GitHub's installation page (the user can choose **Not now**), and "
"**Configure repositories** and **Configure repository access** open the "
"same page."
msgstr ""
"用户令牌留在控制平面，用 `AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY` 加密。GitHub App "
"用户令牌有效期八小时，附带一个六个月有效、只能使用一次的刷新令牌；在到期前五分钟、持有行租约时开始刷新。没有可用令牌的连接不授予任何权限，输入框会请用户重新"
" **Connect GitHub**。连接账号和安装 App 是两个独立步骤：如果 App 没有安装在用户自己的账号上，连接流程会提供 "
"GitHub 的安装页面（用户可以选 **Not now**），**Configure repositories** 和 **Configure "
"repository access** 打开的也是同一页面。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:419
msgid ""
"**Deployment allowlist.** `AGENT_REPO_ALLOWLIST` (comma-separated "
"`owner/name` or `owner/*`) is for single-tenant use. It is not per user: "
"every admitted user may have the platform clone every listed repository "
"with the deployment's App, so list only repositories all of them may work"
" on. It grants no push; pushes and pull requests always use the owner's "
"own connection. When the App's OAuth credentials and "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_INSTALL_URL` are configured, the composer still "
"requires a connection before any repository can be chosen; until then a "
"task runs in a [temporary workspace](#temporary-workspaces)."
msgstr ""
"**部署允许列表**。`AGENT_REPO_ALLOWLIST`（逗号分隔的 `owner/name` 或 "
"`owner/*`）用于单租户场景。它不区分用户：每个获准的用户都可以让平台用部署的 App "
"克隆列表中的每个仓库，所以只列出所有用户都可以处理的仓库。它不授予推送权限；推送和拉取请求始终使用所有者自己的连接。配置了 App 的 OAuth"
" 凭据和 `AGENT_GITHUB_APP_INSTALL_URL` 时，输入框仍要求先连接，才能选择任何仓库；在此之前，任务在[临时工作区"
"](#temporary-workspaces)中运行。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:428
msgid ""
"**Disconnecting.** **Disconnect GitHub** under Integrations deletes the "
"account, token and grants and asks GitHub to withdraw the authorization. "
"Uninstalling the App revokes the platform's installation access."
msgstr ""
"**断开连接**。在 Integrations 中选择 **Disconnect GitHub** 会删除账号、令牌和授权，并请 GitHub "
"撤销授权。在 GitHub 上卸载 App 会撤销平台的安装访问权限。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:432
msgid "Sandbox inventory, resource usage, and controls"
msgstr "沙箱清单、资源用量与操作"

#: ../developer/operations.md:434
msgid ""
"The admin **Sandboxes** tab lists every group recorded as running, "
"including containers retained between turns; the state filter adds "
"stopped, starting, stopping or failed groups, and Fork members share one "
"row. It refreshes every 30 seconds from `GET /admin/agent/sandboxes` "
"(default `state=running`; `state=all` for every state). Search covers "
"titles, repositories, owners, hosts, agent versions and container "
"identifiers, and combines with the host and activity filters; unchecking "
"**Auto-refresh** pauses polling. A sandbox's details show its member "
"sessions, host, runtime, container identity and lifecycle, but no native "
"session identifiers, credentials, prompts or raw container diagnostics."
msgstr ""
"管理后台的 **Sandboxes** "
"标签页列出所有记录为运行中的沙箱组，包括在轮次之间保留的容器；状态过滤器可以加上已停止、启动中、停止中或失败的组，Fork 成员共用一行。它每 "
"30 秒从 `GET /admin/agent/sandboxes` 刷新一次（默认 `state=running`；`state=all` "
"表示所有状态）。搜索覆盖标题、仓库、所有者、主机、agent 版本和容器标识，并可与主机和活动过滤器组合；取消勾选 **Auto-"
"refresh** 会暂停轮询。沙箱详情显示成员会话、主机、运行时、容器标识和生命周期，但不显示原生会话标识、凭据、提示词或原始容器诊断信息。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:444
msgid "Stopping an idle sandbox"
msgstr "停止空闲沙箱"

#: ../developer/operations.md:446
msgid ""
"**Stop idle sandbox** stops the shared container for every member of the "
"group and keeps its workspace and native sessions for a later turn. The "
"API checks the reviewed container, generation and last activity, and "
"refuses a busy group, a group with open terminals, and one whose terminal"
" observations are stale; the host repeats the idle check before stopping."
" When the terminal report is zero, missing or older than 90 seconds, the "
"details (and a stop request) ask the owning sandbox manager for the "
"group's terminal count directly. An unavailable sandbox manager or "
"unknown activity keeps stopping disabled, and the page shows the recovery"
" step. The request is audited and shown as pending until a host "
"observation confirms the stop, so an offline host cannot complete it, and"
" new turns wait meanwhile. Stopping neither deletes the container nor "
"frees its disk."
msgstr ""
"**Stop idle sandbox** 会为组内所有成员停止共享容器，并保留工作区和原生会话供以后的轮次使用。API "
"会检查已审核的容器、代次和最近活动，拒绝繁忙的组、有打开终端的组，以及终端观测数据已过期的组；主机在停止前还会再做一次空闲检查。当终端报告为零、缺失或超过"
" 90 秒时，详情页（以及停止请求）会直接向所属的 Sandbox Manager 查询该组的终端数量。Sandbox Manager "
"不可用或活动状态未知时，停止按钮保持禁用，页面会给出恢复步骤。该请求会记入审计，并一直显示为待处理，直到主机的观测确认已停止，因此离线主机无法完成停止；在此期间新的轮次会等待。停止既不会删除容器，也不会释放其磁盘空间。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:458
msgid "Deleting a sandbox"
msgstr "删除沙箱"

#: ../developer/operations.md:460
msgid ""
"**Archive to S3 and delete** removes a stopped or dead, idle container "
"after its whole retained filesystem (`manifest.json` and `container-"
"rootfs.tar`, with the workspace and native session files) has been "
"uploaded to the **Sandbox archives** bucket and verified ([Sandbox "
"archive storage](#sandbox-archive-storage)). New turns, Fork and "
"workspace operations wait while the archive is prepared. An archive over "
"5 GiB is refused, and a failed upload keeps the container. The host "
"removes the container only after the object's SHA-256 and length match "
"and the receipt is committed; if the host reports the container missing "
"or changed first, the request fails for operator review. Once an archive "
"is verified, an uncertain deletion acknowledgement keeps admission "
"blocked and retries the same request, and the sandbox manager keeps its "
"deletion receipts on its persistent volume across restarts. For a Sandbox"
" Manager rolled back past #763, see [rollback compatibility](#rollback-"
"compatibility)."
msgstr ""
"**Archive to S3 and delete** 会在停止或已退出的空闲容器的整个保留文件系统（`manifest.json` 和 "
"`container-rootfs.tar`，含工作区和原生会话文件）上传到 **Sandbox archives** "
"存储桶并校验通过后，删除该容器（[沙箱归档存储](#sandbox-archive-storage)）。准备归档期间，新的轮次、Fork "
"和工作区操作都会等待。超过 5 GiB 的归档会被拒绝，上传失败时容器保留。只有在对象的 SHA-256 "
"和长度一致、回执已提交之后，主机才会删除容器；如果主机先报告容器缺失或已变化，请求会失败，等待运维人员处理。归档校验通过后，删除确认若不确定，准入会保持阻塞，并重试同一请求；Sandbox"
" Manager 把删除回执保存在自己的持久卷上，重启后仍在。Sandbox Manager 回滚到 #763 之前的情况，见[回滚兼容性"
"](#rollback-compatibility)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:475
msgid ""
"**Delete without archive** removes the same container without uploading "
"anything, and needs no bucket. The host still refuses a running, busy or "
"changed container, and native resume is marked lost only after the host "
"confirms removal. While the host is offline or removed from the pool, the"
" details say so, and what ends the wait: the host reconnecting, or being "
"enrolled again. The exception is a host whose server its provider "
"confirmed `terminated`: after 10 minutes of silence, the container is "
"taken as gone with the machine and the deletion finishes without it "
"(`host_reclaimed` in the trajectory and audit), even after automatic "
"retries have stopped. Let a pending or verified archive deletion finish "
"or fail before you choose this action."
msgstr ""
"**Delete without archive** "
"删除同一个容器，但不上传任何内容，也不需要存储桶。主机仍会拒绝正在运行、繁忙或已变化的容器，并且只有在主机确认删除后，原生续接才会被标记为丢失。主机离线或已从池中移除时，详情页会说明这一点，以及等待何时结束：主机重新连上，或重新注册。例外情况是服务商已确认其服务器为"
" `terminated` 的主机：静默 10 分钟后，容器被视为随机器一起消失，删除不经主机直接完成（轨迹和审计中记为 "
"`host_reclaimed`），即使自动重试已经停止也是如此。如果有待处理或已校验的归档删除，请等它完成或失败后再选择这个操作。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:486
msgid ""
"A `cold` sandbox lives only in its [checkpoint](#restoring-a-removed-"
"hosts-sandboxes), so **Archive to S3 and delete** refuses it. **Delete "
"without archive** deletes it at once, with no host call, once the host it"
" names is gone (removed, forgotten, or silent for 30 minutes). One "
"transaction marks it `lost` and deleted, marks its chats' native context "
"lost, fails their queued turns and supersedes its checkpoint receipts "
"(`checkpoint_only`). The checkpoint objects stay in S3 under the bucket's"
" lifecycle rules; the control plane deletes no objects. Until the host is"
" gone, the next message to one of its chats restores it, and **Remove "
"stale entry** can hide it."
msgstr ""
"`cold` 沙箱只存在于它的[检查点](#restoring-a-removed-hosts-sandboxes)中，所以 **Archive "
"to S3 and delete** 会拒绝它。一旦它所记录的主机已经不在（被移除、被遗忘，或静默 30 分钟），**Delete without"
" archive** 会立即删除它，不需要调用主机。一个事务会把它标记为 `lost` "
"并删除，把它的对话的原生上下文标记为丢失，让排队的轮次失败，并把它的检查点回执标记为已取代（`checkpoint_only`）。检查点对象按存储桶的生命周期规则留在"
" S3 中；控制平面不删除任何对象。主机消失之前，向它的任一对话发送下一条消息就会恢复它，**Remove stale entry** "
"也可以把它隐藏。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:497
msgid ""
"**Sandboxes of deleted chats are removed automatically.** When an owner "
"permanently deletes the last chat in a sandbox on an online host, a sweep"
" that runs every minute (actor `user-deletion-sweeper`, source `system`) "
"stops it and queues its deletion, archived first when a bucket is "
"configured. A sandbox that another chat still uses is never touched."
msgstr ""
"**已删除对话的沙箱会被自动移除**。所有者永久删除某个在线主机上沙箱的最后一个对话后，一个每分钟运行一次的清理任务（操作者为 `user-"
"deletion-sweeper`，来源为 "
"`system`）会停止该沙箱并为其排队删除；配置了存储桶时会先归档。仍被其他对话使用的沙箱永远不会被动。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:503
msgid ""
"**Verify stopped and force delete** recovers a sandbox still recorded as "
"running, but only when the owning sandbox manager confirms that the "
"container is stopped or dead, and idle. On failure, the error names the "
"cause (missing host registration, an absent or refused advertised URL, a "
"missing or rejected sandbox manager credential, a connection failure, a "
"timeout, or unavailable status), and the control plane logs "
"`agent_sandbox_delete_verification_failed`. For a connection failure, "
"check the [reverse sandbox manager route](#the-way-back-the-control-"
"plane-reaching-this-hosts-sandbox-manager)."
msgstr ""
"**Verify stopped and force delete** 用于恢复仍被记录为运行中的沙箱，但前提是所属的 Sandbox "
"Manager 确认容器已停止或已退出，并且空闲。失败时，错误会指出原因（缺少主机注册、通告的 URL 不存在或被拒绝、Sandbox "
"Manager 凭据缺失或被拒绝、连接失败、超时，或状态不可用），控制平面会记录 "
"`agent_sandbox_delete_verification_failed`。如果是连接失败，请检查[反向 Sandbox Manager"
" 路由](#the-way-back-the-control-plane-reaching-this-hosts-sandbox-"
"manager)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:512
msgid ""
"Deletion keeps chat history, memberships, execution records and audit "
"receipts, but deleted native sessions cannot resume. Each row shows a "
"deletion as pending, failed or deleted, and a finished one leaves the "
"default inventory (**Include removed sandboxes** lists it)."
msgstr ""
"删除会保留对话历史、成员关系、执行记录和审计回执，但已删除的原生会话无法续接。每一行把删除显示为待处理、失败或已删除，完成的删除会离开默认清单（**Include"
" removed sandboxes** 会列出它）。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:517
msgid ""
"**How requests run.** One worker handles deletion requests one at a time,"
" in order. Only transient failures retry, with backoff from one minute to"
" one hour, for up to eight claims or 24 hours. A stopped request stays "
"fenced. After you fix the cause, **Resume deletion** starts a new retry "
"window for the same request, keeping its archive or discard choice and "
"any verified receipt. The details show each request's attempts (host, "
"last confirmed stage, outcome, failure code); this history is best-effort"
" and never holds up a deletion."
msgstr ""
"**删除请求如何执行**。一个工作进程按顺序逐个处理删除请求。只有暂时性故障会重试，退避时间从一分钟到一小时，最多认领八次或持续 24 "
"小时。停下的请求仍受栅栏保护。排除原因之后，**Resume deletion** "
"会为同一请求开启新的重试窗口，并保留原先的归档或丢弃选择，以及已校验的回执。详情页显示每个请求的尝试记录（主机、最后确认的阶段、结果、失败代码）；这份历史尽力而为，从不会阻塞删除。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:525
msgid "Removing a stale entry"
msgstr "移除失效条目"

#: ../developer/operations.md:527
msgid ""
"**Remove stale entry** is available when the owning host has not reported"
" for more than 90 seconds. It hides the entry from the default inventory "
"without contacting the sandbox manager, so a retired host does not leave "
"an entry that can never be cleared. The server refuses it while turns, "
"workspace operations, snapshots or a deletion are active. It keeps every "
"record and deletes nothing: no container or file is removed, no archive "
"is made and no disk is freed, so restore the sandbox manager connection "
"to finish archival and deletion. Undo it with **Include removed** and "
"**Restore to inventory**; a matching host observation or new work also "
"brings the entry back. **Remove from inventory** is the same reversible "
"visibility control for stopped sandboxes."
msgstr ""
"所属主机超过 90 秒没有报告时，可以使用 **Remove stale entry**。它会把条目从默认清单中隐藏，而不联系 Sandbox "
"Manager，这样已退役的主机不会留下永远清不掉的条目。有轮次、工作区操作、快照或删除正在进行时，服务器会拒绝这个操作。它保留所有记录，也不删除任何东西：不移除容器或文件，不生成归档，也不释放磁盘，所以要完成归档和真正的删除，需要恢复与"
" Sandbox Manager 的连接。用 **Include removed** 和 **Restore to inventory** "
"可以撤销；匹配的主机观测或新的任务也会让条目重新出现。**Remove from inventory** 是针对已停止沙箱的同类可撤销的隐藏操作。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:538
msgid "Batch operations"
msgstr "批量操作"

#: ../developer/operations.md:540
msgid ""
"Select rows, or **Select all visible sandboxes** (only what the current "
"filters show), choose an action, then **Review selected sandboxes**. The "
"review reads each sandbox's current details and lists blockers. One "
"confirmation then applies the action to the eligible entries, with the "
"same checks as the individual controls, up to four at a time. A stop or "
"deletion result means the request was accepted (a cold sandbox's deletion"
" is done at once). Skipped and failed entries say why and stay selected, "
"and expired reviews and changed containers are refused."
msgstr ""
"勾选若干行，或选择 **Select all visible sandboxes**（只包括当前过滤条件下可见的行），选择一个操作，再点 "
"**Review selected "
"sandboxes**。审查会读取每个沙箱的当前详情并列出阻碍项。确认一次后，操作会应用到符合条件的条目上，检查与单个操作相同，最多同时执行四个。停止或删除的结果表示请求已被接受（cold"
" 沙箱的删除会立即完成）。被跳过和失败的条目会说明原因并保持选中，过期的审查和已变化的容器会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:548
msgid "Resource measurements"
msgstr "资源测量"

#: ../developer/operations.md:550
msgid ""
"CPU is occupied cores between Docker samples, memory excludes inactive "
"file cache, and network and block I/O show cumulative counters and rates,"
" all for the whole shared container. The details also show process and "
"terminal counts, session capacity, active operations, snapshot state and "
"sandbox age (counted from group creation, not container uptime). The "
"sandbox manager samples Docker in the background and sends the "
"observations with the heartbeat, each keeping its original age. Readings "
"older than 90 seconds are marked stale and left out of the fleet totals, "
"which show their coverage; a current heartbeat does not mean current "
"measurements. A host with an older sandbox manager shows resource usage "
"as unavailable. Only the latest observation is stored, so there is no "
"resource history."
msgstr ""
"CPU 是两次 Docker 采样之间占用的核数，内存不含非活跃的文件缓存，网络和块 I/O "
"显示累计计数和速率，这些都针对整个共享容器。详情页还显示进程数和终端数、会话容量、进行中的操作、快照状态以及沙箱存在时长（从沙箱组创建时算起，不是容器运行时长）。Sandbox"
" Manager 在后台采样 Docker，并随心跳发送观测结果，每条结果保留其原始时间。超过 90 "
"秒的读数被标记为过期，不计入集群总量，总量会显示其覆盖范围；心跳是最新的，并不代表测量数据也是最新的。使用旧版 Sandbox Manager "
"的主机会显示资源用量不可用。只保存最新一次观测，因此没有资源历史。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:562
msgid "The owner's Usage page"
msgstr "所有者的 Usage 页面"

#: ../developer/operations.md:564
msgid ""
"**Settings → Usage** (`/settings/usage`) shows each owner their own "
"containers, what the running ones use now, and what their work used over "
"the last 7 or 30 UTC days. It reads three owner-scoped routes, none of "
"which names a host, container ID, image or generation:"
msgstr ""
"**Settings → Usage**（`/settings/usage`）向每个所有者显示他自己的容器、正在运行的容器当前的用量，以及过去 7"
" 或 30 个 UTC 日的用量。它读取三条只限所有者本人的路由，这些路由都不会给出主机、容器 ID、镜像或代次："

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "Route"
msgstr "接口"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "What it reads"
msgstr "读取什么"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`GET /v1/agent/usage/containers`"
msgstr "`GET /v1/agent/usage/containers`"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid ""
"Containers behind chats the owner has not deleted, active first, with "
"limits and the latest sample of a running one. Fresh samples (90 seconds)"
" are summed into current CPU and memory."
msgstr ""
"所有者还没删除的对话背后的容器，活跃的排在前面，附上资源限制，以及运行中容器的最新样本。新鲜的样本（90 秒以内）会加总成当前的 CPU "
"和内存用量。"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`GET /v1/agent/usage/resources?days=`"
msgstr "`GET /v1/agent/usage/resources?days=`"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid ""
"Per UTC day: running time from the lifecycle events in "
"`agent_sandbox_events`, and measured CPU and memory from "
"`agent_sandbox_usage_days`."
msgstr ""
"按 UTC 日统计：根据 `agent_sandbox_events` 里的生命周期事件算出的运行时长，以及 "
"`agent_sandbox_usage_days` 里实测的 CPU 和内存。"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`GET /v1/agent/usage/tokens?days=`"
msgstr "`GET /v1/agent/usage/tokens?days=`"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid ""
"The admin Usage aggregation, filtered to the owner's runs: reported "
"tokens and turns by day and by model (see [Usage](#usage))."
msgstr "管理后台的用量汇总，只取这个所有者的运行：按天、按模型统计的上报 token 数和轮次数（见[用量](#usage)）。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:575
msgid ""
"Running time counts the `starting`, `running` and `stopping` states, with"
" history back to migration `0046_admin_sandbox_trajectory`; CPU and "
"memory history starts with `0077_sandbox_usage_days`. Each accepted "
"sample adds the time since the previous one (at most 120 seconds), and "
"its CPU and memory over that time, to the container's rows for the UTC "
"days it covers, split at midnight. The page shows how much of the running"
" time the measurements cover, and that its days are UTC. It shows no disk"
" usage and no cost."
msgstr ""
"运行时长统计 `starting`、`running` 和 `stopping` 三种状态，历史可追溯到迁移 "
"`0046_admin_sandbox_trajectory`；CPU 和内存历史从 `0077_sandbox_usage_days` "
"开始。每个被接受的样本会把距上一个样本的时间（最多 120 秒），以及这段时间内的 CPU 和内存，计入容器在所覆盖 UTC "
"日的记录中，跨午夜时按午夜拆分。页面会显示测量覆盖了多少运行时长，并注明按 UTC 日计算。它不显示磁盘用量，也不显示费用。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:583
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "用量"

#: ../developer/operations.md:585
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The owner's Usage page, the admin Usage page (`/admin/agent/usage`), a "
"run's usage footer (`/v1/agent/jobs/{id}/usage`) and the admin run detail"
" all show the tokens each turn's agent reported about its own model calls"
" (`source: \"runtime_reported\"`; the per-job read's `runtime.source` is "
"`\"runtime\"`). They are not a provider bill, and these pages hold no "
"pricing, quota or billing. Several accounts using keys of one provider "
"account share that account's allowance. The model relay keeps its own "
"record of provided-model use ([Provided models](#provided-models))."
msgstr ""
"所有者的用量页、管理端用量页（`/admin/agent/usage`）、一次运行的用量页脚（`/v1/agent/jobs/{id}/usage`）以及管理端运行详情，显示的都是每轮"
" agent 自己报告的模型调用 token 数（`source: \"runtime_reported\"`；按任务读取时 "
"`runtime.source` 为 "
"`\"runtime\"`）。这些数字不是服务商账单，这些页面也不涉及价格、配额或计费。多个账号如果使用同一服务商账户下的密钥，会共享该账户的额度。模型中继对部署提供的模型另有自己的用量记录（[部署提供的模型"
"](#provided-models)）。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:594
msgid ""
"Each attempt's events are reduced once into an "
"`agent_attempt_thread_stats` rollup (reducer version 2). A repeated "
"report counts once, a retry's attempt counts as its own report, and a "
"Fork's copied history is not counted again. A turn that reported nothing "
"shows as pending, then unavailable, never as zero."
msgstr ""
"每个 attempt 的事件只归并一次，写入 `agent_attempt_thread_stats` 汇总（归并器版本 "
"2）。重复的报告只计一次，重试的 attempt 算作它自己的报告，Fork "
"复制过来的历史不会重复计算。没有报告任何数据的轮次显示为待定，之后显示为不可用，永远不会显示为零。"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "Agent"
msgstr "智能体"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "What it reports"
msgstr "上报内容"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "Input total"
msgstr "输入合计"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "Claude Code"
msgstr "Claude Code"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid ""
"Anthropic counters per response: uncached input, cache reads, cache "
"writes, output"
msgstr "每个响应的 Anthropic 计数器：未缓存输入、缓存读取、缓存写入、输出"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "The three input counters added"
msgstr "三个输入计数器之和"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "pi"
msgstr "pi"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "The same counters per assistant message"
msgstr "每条助手消息的相同计数器"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "Codex 0.145.0"
msgstr "Codex 0.145.0"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid ""
"`thread/tokenUsage/updated` per model call: `inputTokens` (cached "
"included), `cachedInputTokens`, `cacheWriteInputTokens`, `outputTokens`, "
"`reasoningOutputTokens`"
msgstr ""
"每次模型调用的 "
"`thread/tokenUsage/updated`：`inputTokens`（含缓存）、`cachedInputTokens`、`cacheWriteInputTokens`、`outputTokens`、`reasoningOutputTokens`"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`inputTokens`"
msgstr "`inputTokens`"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "OpenCode, Kilo"
msgstr "OpenCode、Kilo"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "No verified counter shape; any counter they emit is shown as reported"
msgstr "没有经过验证的计数器格式；它们发出的任何计数器都按上报值显示"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "未知"

#: ../developer/operations.md:606
msgid ""
"Only Codex reports reasoning tokens, which are part of the output and "
"shown beside it. No agent reports a cost or a request count, so those are"
" always null."
msgstr "只有 Codex 报告推理 token，它们属于输出的一部分，显示在输出旁边。没有任何 agent 报告费用或请求次数，所以这两项始终为空。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:609
msgid ""
"**What is not counted.** Codex reports each model call with its thread's "
"running total. A call counts toward a turn only when the notification "
"names that running turn, or comes from a subagent spawned during it. "
"Calls from a subagent after its turn ended, or spawned in an earlier turn"
" or process, notifications replayed on resume, and malformed reports "
"count nowhere, so a provider can bill more than the totals show. The "
"pages say so where the numbers appear."
msgstr ""
"**不计入的部分**。Codex 每次模型调用都会报告其线程的累计总数。只有当通知指明了正在运行的那一轮，或来自该轮期间启动的子 agent "
"时，这次调用才计入该轮。子 agent 在其所属轮次结束后的调用、在更早的轮次或进程中启动的子 "
"agent、续接时重放的通知以及格式错误的报告都不计入任何地方，所以服务商的账单可能高于这些总数。页面上显示数字的地方都注明了这一点。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:616
msgid "Reading a task's recorded events"
msgstr "查看任务记录下来的事件"

#: ../developer/operations.md:618
msgid ""
"The admin console shows tool-call measurements and reported token usage, "
"but has no route to a task's raw runtime events; owners read their own "
"through the session routes. **Do not read `agent_job_events.payload` "
"directly.** A `psql` query returns prompt text, tool arguments and tool "
"output with no audit record, no size bound and no column allowlist. If an"
" investigation needs raw events, build an audited route."
msgstr ""
"管理后台显示工具调用的测量数据和报告的 token 用量，但没有查看任务原始运行事件的路由；所有者通过会话路由查看自己的事件。**不要直接读取 "
"`agent_job_events.payload`**。用 `psql` "
"查询会返回提示词文本、工具参数和工具输出，既没有审计记录，也没有大小限制和列白名单。如果排查需要原始事件，请构建一个带审计的路由。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:625
msgid ""
"**The audit trail.** _Admin → Audit log_ (`GET /admin/agent/audit-log`) "
"shows who did what, to whom, with what result, newest first, paged by "
"`before` (the oldest `id` of the previous page). Each action is declared "
"once in `cloud_agent/domain/audit.py`, with a `category` (`accounts`, "
"`settings`, `servers`, `sandboxes`, `measurements`, `sensitive_access`, "
"`access_control`), its target (`target_type`, `target_id`) and the user "
"it affected (`target_user_id`)."
msgstr ""
"**审计记录**。_Admin → Audit log_（`GET /admin/agent/audit-"
"log`）按时间倒序显示谁对谁做了什么、结果如何，用 `before`（上一页最早的 `id`）分页。每个操作只在 "
"`cloud_agent/domain/audit.py` 中声明一次，包括一个 "
"`category`（`accounts`、`settings`、`servers`、`sandboxes`、`measurements`、`sensitive_access`、`access_control`）、操作对象（`target_type`、`target_id`）以及受影响的用户（`target_user_id`）。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:633
msgid ""
"**Who acted** (`actor_type`, derived from `actor_id`): `admin`, "
"`break_glass` (`ADMIN_TOKEN`, first-run setup, the bootstrap command), "
"`service`, `system`, `user` or `anonymous`. The page shows `admin` and "
"`break_glass` unless asked for everything (`actors=all`); break-glass "
"access is always shown, in red."
msgstr ""
"**操作者**（`actor_type`，由 `actor_id` "
"推导）：`admin`、`break_glass`（`ADMIN_TOKEN`、首次运行设置、引导命令）、`service`、`system`、`user`"
" 或 `anonymous`。页面默认只显示 `admin` 和 "
"`break_glass`，要求显示全部时（`actors=all`）才显示其他类型；break-glass 访问始终以红色显示。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:637
msgid ""
"**Names** are kept as they were when the row was written, with a short id"
" beside them. Erasing an account deletes no audit row."
msgstr "**名称**保留写入时的样子，旁边附短 ID。清除账号不会删除任何审计行。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:639
msgid ""
"**Outcome** is `applied`, `refused`, `failed`, `replayed`, or `requested`"
" for work that runs later. A requested sandbox deletion or compute "
"operation carries its final result; the worker's steps are in the "
"sandbox's trajectory."
msgstr ""
"**结果**为 `applied`、`refused`、`failed`、`replayed`，稍后执行的工作则为 "
"`requested`。被请求的沙箱删除或计算操作会带上其最终结果；工作进程的各个步骤记录在沙箱的轨迹中。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:642
msgid ""
"**Filters.** `user=<account id>` shows everything about an account, and "
"`target_type=` with `target_id=` everything about one host, sandbox or "
"server operation."
msgstr ""
"**过滤**。`user=<account id>` 显示与某个账号有关的全部记录，`target_type=` 加 `target_id=` "
"显示与某台主机、某个沙箱或某次服务器操作有关的全部记录。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:645
msgid ""
"**Recording never blocks an action.** A row that cannot be written is "
"logged as `agent_admin_audit_write_failed`, counted in "
"`agent_admin_audit_write_failures`, and reported at the top of the page "
"for seven days."
msgstr ""
"**记录失败不会阻止操作**。无法写入的行会记录为 `agent_admin_audit_write_failed`，计入 "
"`agent_admin_audit_write_failures`，并在页面顶部提示七天。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:650
msgid "Reads and connection checks are not recorded."
msgstr "读取和连接检查不会被记录。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:652
msgid "Teams"
msgstr "团队"

#: ../developer/operations.md:654
msgid ""
"Owners and admins manage their teams from **Settings → Teams**. Platform "
"administrators see every team, read-only, under **Admin → Users → "
"Teams**:"
msgstr ""
"所有者和管理员在 **Settings → Teams** 中管理自己的团队。平台管理员可以在 **Admin → Users → Teams**"
" 中以只读方式查看所有团队："

#: ../developer/operations.md:657
msgid ""
"The list (`GET /admin/agent/teams`) shows teams newest first, with the "
"owner, active members, admins and pending join requests. `state` is "
"`active` (default), `deleted` or `all`; `q` matches part of a team name, "
"a team id, or the user id of anyone who has been a member. It pages with "
"`before` (the response's `next_before`)."
msgstr ""
"列表（`GET /admin/agent/teams`）按创建时间倒序显示团队，包括所有者、活跃成员、管理员和待处理的加入申请。`state` "
"可以是 `active`（默认）、`deleted` 或 `all`；`q` 匹配团队名称的一部分、团队 ID，或任何曾经是成员的用户 ID。它用"
" `before`（响应中的 `next_before`）分页。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:662
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A team's page (`GET /admin/agent/teams/{team_id}`) lists the active "
"members, the 50 most recent departures (`departed_member_count` counts "
"them all), the 50 oldest open join requests (`pending_request_count`) and"
" the invitation link counts. `GET /admin/agent/teams/{team_id}/audit-"
"events` pages the team's audit history with `before`."
msgstr ""
"团队页面（`GET /admin/agent/teams/{team_id}`）列出活跃成员、最近离开的 50 "
"人（`departed_member_count` 统计全部离开的人）、最早的 50 "
"个待处理加入申请（`pending_request_count`）以及邀请链接的数量。`GET "
"/admin/agent/teams/{team_id}/audit-events` 用 `before` 分页查看团队的审计历史。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:668
msgid ""
"**Show in People** opens a team's members in **Admin → Users → People**. "
"Names and emails are read on each request and never stored. These pages "
"change nothing, so they leave no audit record. You cannot yet move "
"ownership of a team whose owner lost access."
msgstr ""
"**Show in People** 会在 **Admin → Users → People** "
"中打开团队成员。姓名和邮箱在每次请求时读取，从不保存。这些页面不做任何修改，所以不留审计记录。目前还不能转移所有者已失去访问权限的团队的所有权。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:673
msgid "MCP servers"
msgstr "MCP 服务器"

#: ../developer/operations.md:675
msgid ""
"MCP calls pass through the control plane. The sandbox holds only a scoped"
" relay credential; upstream credentials stay outside it:"
msgstr "MCP 调用经过控制平面。沙箱只持有一个限定范围的中继凭据，上游凭据留在沙箱之外："

#: ../developer/operations.md:682
msgid ""
"A member's CLI serves several turns, so it holds its residency's "
"credential (`amr.…`). On every call, the relay resolves it to that chat's"
" current attempt and checks that the attempt is leased, its job running "
"and not stopped, and its host enrolled. Between turns, or once the "
"residency rotates, expires or is released, it authorizes nothing. A "
"follow-up whose MCP servers did not change keeps the live process; adding"
" or removing a connection restarts it, because a CLI reads its servers "
"once, at start. A request keeps the attempt and residency it was "
"authenticated with, and the relay checks both again after waiting for "
"OAuth, an approval or an upstream session. Memory writes, Web Search "
"admission and approval claims also check the residency inside their "
"transactions."
msgstr ""
"成员的 CLI 要服务多个轮次，所以它持有其 residency 的凭据（`amr.…`）。每次调用时，中继把它解析为该对话当前的 "
"attempt，并检查这个 attempt 持有租约、其任务正在运行且未被停止、其主机已注册。在两轮之间，或 residency "
"轮换、过期或释放之后，它不授权任何操作。MCP 服务器没有变化的后续消息会沿用正在运行的进程；增加或移除连接会重启进程，因为 CLI "
"只在启动时读取一次服务器列表。请求会保持认证时的 attempt 和 residency，中继在等待 "
"OAuth、审批或上游会话之后会再次检查两者。记忆写入、Web Search 准入和审批认领也会在各自的事务中检查 residency。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:693
msgid "Listeners and connections"
msgstr "监听器与连接"

#: ../developer/operations.md:695
msgid ""
"The MCP listener is a separate FastAPI app on port 8001 that serves only "
"the MCP tool surface. Sandboxes reach `/v1/agent/mcp` on it over the MCP "
"tunnel on their group bridge."
msgstr ""
"MCP 监听进程是一个独立的 FastAPI 应用，监听 8001 端口，只提供 MCP 工具接口。沙箱通过其组网桥上的 MCP 隧道访问其中的 "
"`/v1/agent/mcp`。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:699
msgid ""
"**Keep the tool relay off the public main API.** The public edge forwards"
" `/api/*` to port 8000, where no tool route is mounted, so a leaked `mcp`"
" token cannot be replayed there. Connection management, OAuth callbacks "
"and approvals also use the `/v1/agent/mcp` prefix and must stay on 8000, "
"so do not block the whole prefix at the edge. Point the sandbox MCP "
"tunnel at 8001."
msgstr ""
"**不要让工具中继出现在公开的主 API 上**。公开入口把 `/api/*` 转发到 8000 端口，那里没有挂载任何工具路由，所以泄露的 "
"`mcp` 令牌无法在那里重放。连接管理、OAuth 回调和审批同样使用 `/v1/agent/mcp` 前缀，并且必须留在 8000 "
"端口，所以不要在入口处屏蔽整个前缀。把沙箱的 MCP 隧道指向 8001。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:705
msgid ""
"Users add connections through `/v1/agent/mcp`: a remote URL, an imported "
"`mcpServers` snippet, or a stdio launch specification. "
"`agent_mcp_connections` stores the configuration and the credential, "
"encrypted with `AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY` under an MCP-"
"specific domain, and discovery stores a capability snapshot. Templates "
"only prefill the form. MCP OAuth uses `AGENT_MCP_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` for the"
" API callback and `AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL` for the browser's return to "
"`/integrations`, for example `https://agents.example.org/api` and "
"`https://agents.example.org`."
msgstr ""
"用户通过 `/v1/agent/mcp` 添加连接：远程 URL、导入的 `mcpServers` 片段，或 stdio "
"启动说明。`agent_mcp_connections` 保存配置和凭据，凭据用 "
"`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY` 在 MCP "
"专用的域下加密；发现过程会保存一份能力快照。模板只用来预填表单。MCP OAuth 用 `AGENT_MCP_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` "
"作为 API 回调地址，用 `AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL` 作为浏览器返回 `/integrations` 的地址，例如 "
"`https://agents.example.org/api` 和 `https://agents.example.org`。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:714
msgid ""
"Of the optional protocol capabilities, the platform answers only `roots`."
" When a server offers elicitation, sampling, resource subscriptions, "
"tasks or MCP Apps, the connection's diagnostics mark them unsupported."
msgstr ""
"在可选的协议能力中，平台只响应 `roots`。服务器提供 elicitation、sampling、资源订阅、tasks 或 MCP Apps "
"时，连接的诊断信息会把它们标记为不支持。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:718
msgid "Authorization and routing"
msgstr "授权与路由"

#: ../developer/operations.md:720
msgid ""
"**Nothing is reachable by name.** A tool name's prefix is a _binding "
"alias_ (the name one conversation gave one connection), and a token names"
" a job, so the relay resolves the alias against that job's own bindings. "
"Nobody can name a connection that someone else added."
msgstr "**不能凭名称访问任何东西**。工具名的前缀是一个*绑定别名*（某个对话给某个连接起的名字），而令牌指明的是一个任务，所以中继按该任务自己的绑定来解析别名。谁也无法通过命名去使用别人添加的连接。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:724
msgid ""
"**Every capability has a policy:** `deny`, `confirm` or `allow`. An "
"omitted capability is denied, including one the server adds later, and a "
"policy whose tool description or schema changed goes back to the owner."
msgstr ""
"**每项能力都有一条策略**：`deny`、`confirm` 或 `allow`。未列出的能力一律拒绝，包括服务器后来新增的能力；工具描述或 "
"schema 发生变化的策略会交回所有者重新决定。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:727
msgid ""
"**`confirm` holds the original call** until the owner decides in the "
"conversation's Tools panel or the [Approvals inbox](web-app.md#tool-"
"approvals). Approval dispatches it once, under the current attempt and "
"permission fence, and the CLI gets the result without the model retrying."
" Denial, expiry or changed authorization drops it."
msgstr ""
"**`confirm` 会暂停原始调用**，直到所有者在对话的 Tools 面板或[审批收件箱](web-app.md#tool-"
"approvals)中作出决定。批准后，调用会在当前的 attempt 和权限栅栏下执行一次，CLI "
"拿到结果，模型不需要重试。拒绝、过期或授权变化都会丢弃这次调用。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:732
msgid ""
"**Credentials fail closed.** A missing encryption key, unreadable "
"ciphertext, an expired connection with no refresh, or a disconnected "
"connection removes that server from the owner's reachable set, and the "
"Integrations page says why."
msgstr ""
"**凭据出问题时一律拒绝**。缺少加密密钥、密文无法读取、连接已过期且无法刷新，或连接已断开，都会把该服务器从所有者可访问的集合中移除，Integrations"
" 页面会说明原因。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:736
msgid ""
"**Bindings are read on every call**, so narrowing a session takes effect "
"on its next call."
msgstr "**每次调用都会重新读取绑定**，所以收窄会话的权限会在下一次调用时生效。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:738
msgid ""
"**One endpoint.** `/v1/agent/mcp` merges the job's connections into one "
"catalogue, which all five adapters receive as one entry named `session`. "
"It answers requests only, and talks to legacy SSE servers itself."
msgstr ""
"**一个端点**。`/v1/agent/mcp` 把任务的各个连接合并成一个目录，五个适配器都把它作为一个名为 `session` "
"的条目接收。它只响应请求，旧式 SSE 服务器由它自己对接。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:742
msgid ""
"Tools and prompts appear as `<alias>__<name>`, looked up in the "
"catalogue, never split on `__`; ambiguous or long names get a stable, "
"bounded suffix. Resources appear as `mcp-resource://<connection-id"
">/<original-uri>`. Resources and prompts have their own permission "
"scopes, decided like tools. An unresolved connection is logged and "
"skipped, so the others stay usable."
msgstr ""
"工具和提示词以 `<alias>__<name>` 的形式出现，在目录中查找，从不按 `__` "
"拆分；有歧义或过长的名称会加上稳定、长度有限的后缀。资源以 `mcp-resource://<connection-id>/<original-"
"uri>` 的形式出现。资源和提示词有各自的权限范围，判定方式与工具相同。无法解析的连接会被记录并跳过，其他连接仍可使用。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:748
msgid ""
"The merged endpoint also serves the platform's own tools: `web_search` "
"when a search provider is configured, and `memory_save`, `memory_update` "
"and `memory_delete` for every task (named in the claim by the markers "
"`:platform:web-search` and `:platform:memory`). A memory tool writes only"
" for the owner and task its fenced token names, and only to that task's "
"repository or the owner's user scope."
msgstr ""
"合并后的端点还提供平台自己的工具：配置了搜索服务时提供 `web_search`，每个任务都提供 "
"`memory_save`、`memory_update` 和 `memory_delete`（在认领中用 `:platform:web-"
"search` 和 `:platform:memory` "
"两个标记指明）。记忆工具只为其受栅栏约束的令牌所指明的所有者和任务写入，并且只写入该任务的仓库或所有者的用户范围。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:755
msgid "End-to-end coverage"
msgstr "端到端测试覆盖"

#: ../developer/operations.md:757
msgid ""
"`tests/external/test_agent_mcp_end_to_end.py` runs a real listener, a "
"migrated Postgres, the image's pi 0.73.1 CLI (or the release named by "
"`AGENT_PI_TEST_VERSION`) and the shipped bridge, against stub model and "
"MCP servers. It checks that the model sees `session__github__get_issue`, "
"that the upstream receives `server/discover`, `initialize` and "
"`tools/call` with the connection's credential instead of the sandbox "
"token and with the tool name `get_issue`, and that a handshake follows "
"when the era probe returns `-32601`. It needs Postgres, npm and network "
"access, skips without them, and belongs to the external tier. Run it "
"after changing the merged endpoint, host or bridge."
msgstr ""
"`tests/external/test_agent_mcp_end_to_end.py` 针对桩模型和桩 MCP "
"服务器，运行真实的监听进程、已迁移的 Postgres、镜像中的 pi 0.73.1 CLI（或 `AGENT_PI_TEST_VERSION` "
"指定的版本）以及随镜像发布的桥接程序。它检查模型看到的是 `session__github__get_issue`，上游收到的 "
"`server/discover`、`initialize` 和 `tools/call` 带的是连接的凭据而不是沙箱令牌、工具名是 "
"`get_issue`，并检查当时代探测返回 `-32601` 时会改走握手流程。它需要 Postgres、npm "
"和网络访问，缺少时会跳过，属于外部测试层。修改合并端点、主机或桥接程序后请运行它。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:767
msgid "Where a connection runs"
msgstr "连接在哪里运行"

#: ../developer/operations.md:769
msgid ""
"An address runs as a `remote` service behind this relay, and a command as"
" a `sandbox` program ([sandbox MCP servers](#sandbox-mcp-servers)); the "
"API refuses any other location. Connections stored at the old `managed-"
"worker` or `user-connector` locations were moved to `sandbox` ([upgrade "
"notes](upgrade-notes.md#mcp-servers-run-in-two-places)), and the "
"connector tables and `agent_mcp_connections.connector_id` are unused."
msgstr ""
"地址作为此中继后面的 `remote` 服务运行，命令作为 `sandbox` 程序运行（[沙箱 MCP 服务器](#sandbox-mcp-"
"servers)）；API 拒绝任何其他位置。保存在旧的 `managed-worker` 或 `user-connector` 位置的连接已迁到"
" `sandbox`（[升级说明](upgrade-notes.md#mcp-servers-run-in-two-"
"places)），connector 相关的表和 `agent_mcp_connections.connector_id` 已不再使用。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:776
msgid "Deployment and rollback"
msgstr "部署与回滚"

#: ../developer/operations.md:778
msgid ""
"Apply migrations through head before replacing the API, then deploy the "
"runner and sandbox artifacts from the same release; MCP is on for every "
"runtime. The migration that introduced per-user connections put the "
"legacy server names it could not map unambiguously into "
"`agent_mcp_legacy_bindings` (`no_connection` or `ambiguous_connection`). "
"Review those rows as the sessions that need manual tool selection. The "
"empty `agent_threads.mcp_servers` and always-NULL "
"`agent_mcp_connections.server` columns cannot authorize anything."
msgstr ""
"替换 API 之前先把迁移执行到 head，然后部署同一版本的 runner 和沙箱制品；所有运行时都已启用 "
"MCP。引入按用户连接的那次迁移，把无法唯一对应的旧服务器名称放进了 "
"`agent_mcp_legacy_bindings`（`no_connection` 或 "
"`ambiguous_connection`）。把这些行当作需要手动选择工具的会话清单逐一核对。空的 "
"`agent_threads.mcp_servers` 列和恒为 NULL 的 `agent_mcp_connections.server` "
"列不能授权任何操作。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:786
msgid ""
"Before launching members, the runner upgrades retained containers' "
"adapter files and the patched Kilo 7.4.17 (built from the revision and "
"patch recorded beside `build-kilo.sh`; another version needs a reviewed "
"build), and installs Codex's system allowlist, with no host bind mount or"
" extra capability. A rollback must keep a schema-compatible service and "
"the migrated data; fix forward when a downgrade would discard them. MCP "
"credentials share `AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY` with source "
"control, separated by domain."
msgstr ""
"启动成员之前，runner 会升级保留容器中的适配器文件和打过补丁的 Kilo 7.4.17（按 `build-kilo.sh` "
"旁边记录的版本和补丁构建；其他版本需要经过审查的构建），并安装 Codex "
"的系统允许列表，既不需要主机绑定挂载，也不需要额外的能力。回滚时必须保留与 schema "
"兼容的服务和已迁移的数据；如果降级会丢弃这些数据，就向前修复。MCP 凭据与源码管理共用 "
"`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`，通过加密域相互隔离。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:794
msgid "Runtime boundaries"
msgstr "运行时边界"

#: ../developer/operations.md:796
msgid ""
"Claude Code retries transient inference failures (HTTP 429 and 5xx) "
"within the native request. The resident launch sets "
"`CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_RETRIES=15` and `CLAUDE_CODE_RETRY_WATCHDOG=0`, and the "
"pinned CLI backs off from 500 ms to 32 seconds plus up to 25% jitter, "
"honoring an integer `Retry-After` of up to 60 seconds. Retries keep "
"completed tool calls and the native session; when they run out, the turn "
"fails with its context kept, and the runner never resends the prompt. "
"HTTP 400 and 403 are not retried, and 401 keeps the CLI's own credential "
"refresh. The runner's execution timeout still bounds the turn, owner "
"cancellation still interrupts a backoff, and the chat shows each retry."
msgstr ""
"Claude Code 会在原生请求内部重试暂时性的推理失败（HTTP 429 和 5xx）。常驻启动会设置 "
"`CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_RETRIES=15` 和 `CLAUDE_CODE_RETRY_WATCHDOG=0`，固定版本的 CLI 从"
" 500 ms 退避到 32 秒，并加上最多 25% 的抖动，同时遵守最长 60 秒的整数 `Retry-"
"After`。重试会保留已完成的工具调用和原生会话；重试用尽时，该轮失败但保留上下文，runner 从不重发提示词。HTTP 400 和 403 "
"不重试，401 则交给 CLI 自己的凭据刷新机制。runner 的执行超时仍然限制整轮，所有者取消仍可中断退避，对话中会显示每次重试。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:806
msgid ""
"An adapter declares MCP support only after both behaviors are checked "
"against the pinned binary: it points the CLI at the platform relay, and "
"it stops every other MCP configuration source from adding servers. A job "
"that names connections on a runtime without MCP support is refused at "
"creation."
msgstr ""
"只有在固定版本的二进制文件上验证过两件事之后，适配器才会声明支持 MCP：它把 CLI 指向平台中继，并且阻止其他所有 MCP "
"配置来源添加服务器。在不支持 MCP 的运行时上指定连接的任务，会在创建时被拒绝。"

