msgid ""
"**Use the runtime's credential-reference syntax.** Claude Code expands "
"`${AGENT_MCP_TOKEN}`, and the OpenCode family substitutes "
"`{env:AGENT_MCP_TOKEN}`; the wrong syntax sends a literal placeholder as "
"the bearer token and gets 401. The adapters in "
"`apps/backend/cloud_agent_host/runtimes/` choose the address, and the CLI"
" adapters in `deploy/sandbox/` write the reference. The token travels in "
"the environment, never in argv or a configuration file."
msgstr ""
"**使用运行时自己的凭据引用语法**。Claude Code 展开 `${AGENT_MCP_TOKEN}`，OpenCode 系列替换 "
"`{env:AGENT_MCP_TOKEN}`；语法写错会把字面占位符当作 bearer 令牌发送，得到 "
"401。`apps/backend/cloud_agent_host/runtimes/` 中的适配器选择地址，`deploy/sandbox/`"
" 中的 CLI 适配器写入引用。令牌通过环境变量传递，从不出现在 argv 或配置文件中。"

