"Playwright（`connectOverCDP`、Playwright MCP 的 `--cdp-"
"endpoint`）、Puppeteer（`browserWSEndpoint`）或 Chrome DevTools "
"MCP（`--wsEndpoint`）连接。见[设计](../agents/specs/2026-11-02-computer-use-base-"
"capability.md)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:859
msgid ""
"**Shared by the sandbox.** A chat and its Forks share one browser, tabs "
"and sign-ins included. It runs as `agent-browser` (uid 10002), so a "
"member's turn-end reap never stops it. The host runs `cloud-agent-browser"
" service start` before each member launch, and a failure never blocks the"
" chat."
msgstr ""
"**整个沙箱共用**。一个对话和它的 Fork 共用一个浏览器，包括标签页和登录状态。它以 `agent-browser`（uid "
"10002）身份运行，所以成员在轮次结束时的进程清理不会停止它。主机在每次启动成员前运行 `cloud-agent-browser service"
" start`，失败也不会阻塞对话。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:863
msgid ""
"**Isolation.** Chromium speaks CDP only over a pipe to the launcher, "
"which serves it on loopback behind a random token in `/run/agent-browser`"
" (written only by `agent-browser`, readable only by the sandbox group). "
"Clients cannot reach each other's CDP sessions."
msgstr ""
"**隔离**。Chromium 只通过管道与启动器传递 CDP，启动器再在回环地址上以随机令牌对外提供它，令牌放在 `/run/agent-"
"browser` 中（只有 `agent-browser` 能写，只有沙箱用户组能读）。各客户端无法访问彼此的 CDP 会话。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:867
msgid ""
"**Chromium's own sandbox is off.** Docker's default seccomp profile "
"refuses the user namespaces it needs, under runc and Kata alike, so "
"Chromium runs with `--no-sandbox`, and the container and the Kata VM are "
"the boundary. `cloud-agent-browser status` reports `chromium_sandbox`."
msgstr ""
"**Chromium 自带的沙箱是关闭的**。无论 runc 还是 Kata，Docker 默认的 seccomp "
"配置都会拒绝它所需的用户命名空间，所以 Chromium 以 `--no-sandbox` 运行，由容器和 Kata 虚拟机充当边界"
"。`cloud-agent-browser status` 会报告 `chromium_sandbox`。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:871
msgid ""
"**Downloads** are staged by the service and copied into the member's "
"private download directory. One that cannot be handed over shows as "
"canceled, and the service log says why."
msgstr "**下载**由服务先暂存，再复制到成员私有的下载目录。无法交付的下载会显示为已取消，服务日志会说明原因。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:874
msgid ""
"**Lifecycle.** Chromium starts with the first client and stops after 15 "
"minutes without one (`CLOUD_AGENT_BROWSER_IDLE_S`). The profile (`/home"
"/agent-browser/profile`) stays in the retained container, and `cloud-"
"agent-browser stop` closes Chromium for every member."
msgstr ""
"**生命周期**。第一个客户端连接时启动 Chromium，15 "
"分钟没有客户端后停止（`CLOUD_AGENT_BROWSER_IDLE_S`）。配置目录（`/home/agent-"
"browser/profile`）留在保留容器中，`cloud-agent-browser stop` 会为所有成员关闭 Chromium。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:878
msgid ""
"**Resources.** About 174 MiB and 140 threads idle, and 321 MiB and 213 "
"threads with four pages open, counted against the group's memory limit "
"and its 512-process limit, which counts threads. At most four renderer "
"processes run."
msgstr ""
"**资源**。空闲时约 174 MiB、140 个线程，打开四个页面时约 321 MiB、213 个线程，计入沙箱组的内存限制和 512 "
"个进程的限制（线程也算在内）。最多运行四个渲染进程。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:881
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Screenshots** go to `/workspace/.cloud-agent-artifacts` "
"(`CLOUD_AGENT_ARTIFACTS_DIR`), which is listed in `.git/info/exclude`. A "
"turn shows the images written there (`GET "
"/v1/agent/jobs/{job_id}/artifacts/images`, up to 200), and `GET "
"/v1/agent/jobs/{job_id}/files/image` opens PNG, JPEG, GIF and WebP files "
"of up to 10 MiB."
msgstr ""
"**截图**保存到 `/workspace/.cloud-agent-"
"artifacts`（`CLOUD_AGENT_ARTIFACTS_DIR`），该目录已列入 "
"`.git/info/exclude`。一轮会显示该轮期间写入其中的图片（`GET "
"/v1/agent/jobs/{job_id}/artifacts/images`，最多 200 张），`GET "
"/v1/agent/jobs/{job_id}/files/image` 可以打开不超过 10 MiB 的 PNG、JPEG、GIF 和 WebP"
" 文件。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:888
msgid ""
"To check a host, run `cloud-agent-browser status` and `cloud-agent-"
"browser self-test` in a sandbox; the image build runs the self-test too. "
"`/run/agent-browser/daemon.log` has the service's log. A container "
"created from an image without the browser has none until it is recreated."
msgstr ""
"要检查一台主机，在沙箱中运行 `cloud-agent-browser status` 和 `cloud-agent-browser self-"
"test`；镜像构建时也会运行自检。`/run/agent-browser/daemon.log` "
"是服务日志。由不含浏览器的镜像创建的容器，在重新创建之前都没有浏览器。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:893
msgid "Sandbox MCP servers"
msgstr "沙箱 MCP 服务器"

#: ../developer/operations.md:895
msgid ""
"An MCP connection can run in each chat's sandbox (location `sandbox`), "
"where it reaches the task's `localhost`, files and the sandbox browser; "
"the Playwright and Chrome DevTools presets drive that browser. See the "
"[design](../agents/specs/2026-11-02-computer-use-base-capability.md#in-"
"sandbox-mcp-servers-phase-2)."
msgstr ""
"MCP 连接可以运行在每个对话的沙箱中（位置为 `sandbox`），这样它能访问任务的 "
"`localhost`、文件和沙箱浏览器；Playwright 和 Chrome DevTools "
"预设就是用来驱动这个浏览器的。见[设计](../agents/specs/2026-11-02-computer-use-base-"
"capability.md#in-sandbox-mcp-servers-phase-2)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:900
msgid ""
"**What may run.** One exactly pinned package started by `npx` or `uvx`, "
"with no mount or working directory. An import pins a bare name, or a tag "
"such as `latest`, to the release the public registry names at that moment"
" (`cloud_agent/mcp/package_pins.py`); a range or an unknown package is "
"refused."
msgstr ""
"**可以运行什么**。由 `npx` 或 `uvx` 启动的、版本精确固定的单个软件包，不带挂载和工作目录。导入时，裸包名或 `latest` "
"之类的标签会被固定为公共仓库当时给出的版本（`cloud_agent/mcp/package_pins.py`）；版本范围或找不到的软件包会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:904
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Credentials.** Keys pasted with it are sealed at rest and named "
"`secret://NAME`, and `${NAME}` is filled from the chat's environment. The"
" host hands both only to the slot's runner, in `/run/agent-mcp-"
"slots/<slot>/secrets.json`, which only that runner's user can read. A "
"sealed key shorter than 8 characters is refused, because the runner masks"
" only longer keys. An edit keeps the stored keys only while the command "
"and arguments stay the same apart from the package release; any other "
"change must send the keys again."
msgstr ""
"**凭据**。随它粘贴的密钥会被加密保存，命名为 `secret://NAME`，`${NAME}` "
"则从对话的环境中取值。主机只把两者交给该槽位的 runner，放在只有该 runner 用户能读的 `/run/agent-mcp-"
"slots/<slot>/secrets.json` 中。短于 8 个字符的加密密钥会被拒绝，因为 runner "
"只会屏蔽更长的密钥。编辑时，只有命令和参数除软件包版本外保持不变，已存的密钥才会保留；其他任何修改都必须重新提交密钥。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:912
msgid ""
"**How it runs.** Before launching a member's CLI, the host writes the "
"slot's admission as root, starts the image's MCP gateway, `cloud-agent-"
"mcp`, as `agent-mcp` (uid 10003) on `http://127.0.0.1:47801/mcp`, then "
"starts the slot's runner as `agent-mcp-<slot>` (uid 12001 + slot). The "
"CLI reaches the servers as the MCP server `sandbox`, with its relay "
"token. A server affects only its own slot, and a failure leaves the chat "
"without those tools but still runs the turn."
msgstr ""
"**如何运行**。启动成员的 CLI 之前，主机以 root 写入该槽位的准入信息，以 `agent-mcp`（uid 10003）在 "
"`http://127.0.0.1:47801/mcp` 上启动镜像中的 MCP 网关 `cloud-agent-mcp`，然后以 `agent-"
"mcp-<slot>`（uid 12001 + slot）启动该槽位的 runner。CLI 把这些服务器作为名为 `sandbox` 的 MCP"
" 服务器访问，使用其中继令牌。一个服务器只能影响自己的槽位；启动失败时，对话没有这些工具，但该轮照常运行。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:919
msgid ""
"**No approval step.** The relay's per-tool policies do not apply: a "
"sandbox server can do what the agent's shell can. Changes take effect at "
"the next turn."
msgstr "**没有审批步骤**。中继的逐工具策略在这里不适用：沙箱服务器能做 agent 的 shell 能做的任何事。修改在下一轮生效。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:922
msgid ""
"**Where to look.** `/run/agent-mcp/gateway.log` records the methods each "
"slot called (readable as `agent-mcp`); `/run/agent-mcp-"
"slots/<slot>/runner.log` and `/run/agent-mcp-slots/<slot>/<alias>.log` "
"are readable as `agent-mcp-<slot>`; admissions are in `/run/agent-mcp-"
"admissions`. When a CLI lists a slot's tools, the gateway reports them to"
" the relay (`cloud_agent/sandbox_tools`), and the connection's card shows"
" them."
msgstr ""
"**到哪里查看**。`/run/agent-mcp/gateway.log` 记录每个槽位调用了哪些方法（以 `agent-mcp` "
"身份可读）；`/run/agent-mcp-slots/<slot>/runner.log` 和 `/run/agent-mcp-"
"slots/<slot>/<alias>.log` 以 `agent-mcp-<slot>` 身份可读；准入信息在 `/run/agent-"
"mcp-admissions` 中。CLI "
"列出某个槽位的工具时，网关会把它们报告给中继（`cloud_agent/sandbox_tools`），连接卡片上会显示这些工具。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:929
msgid "Sandbox incidents"
msgstr "沙箱事件"

#: ../developer/operations.md:931
msgid ""
"The host records what goes wrong in each retained sandbox as "
"**incidents** in the sandbox's event list, and the sandbox list shows the"
" newest one within a day under the sandbox's name. See the "
"[design](../agents/specs/2026-11-04-sandbox-incidents.md)."
msgstr ""
"主机会把每个保留沙箱中出现的问题记录为**事件**，放在沙箱的事件列表里；沙箱列表会在沙箱名称下显示一天内最新的一条。见[设计](../agents/specs/2026-11-04"
"-sandbox-incidents.md)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:935
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Kinds.** `out_of_memory` (the OOM killer killed a process), "
"`container_exited` (a `die` nobody asked for), `memory_high` and "
"`pids_high` (a reading at 90% of the limit), `browser_crashed`, and "
"`mcp_server_failed` (a sandbox MCP program could not start or exited on "
"its own; it names the chat and the server). A stop or deletion the "
"platform made is not an incident."
msgstr ""
"**类型**。`out_of_memory`（OOM killer 杀掉了某个进程）、`container_exited`（没有人要求的 "
"`die`）、`memory_high` 和 `pids_high`（读数达到上限的 90%）、`browser_crashed`，以及 "
"`mcp_server_failed`（某个沙箱 MCP 程序无法启动或自行退出；会写明对话和服务器）。平台自己执行的停止或删除不算事件。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:940
msgid ""
"**Repeats.** Repeats of a kind within a minute become one `.repeated` row"
" with a count. A sandbox records at most 60 rows an hour, and one "
"`dropped` row counts the rest."
msgstr ""
"**重复**。一分钟内同类事件的重复会合并为一行带计数的 `.repeated`。每个沙箱每小时最多记录 60 行，另有一行 `dropped` "
"统计其余的事件。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:943
msgid ""
"**What people see.** A running chat shows a line for `out_of_memory`, "
"`container_exited` and its own `mcp_server_failed`, and the agent's next "
"prompt lists what happened since it was last told."
msgstr ""
"**用户能看到什么**。运行中的对话会为 `out_of_memory`、`container_exited` 以及与自己相关的 "
"`mcp_server_failed` 显示一行提示，agent 的下一次提示词会列出上次告知之后发生的事件。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:946
msgid ""
"**Contents.** Kinds, times, exit codes, limits and MCP aliases only: no "
"stderr, URL, command line or environment."
msgstr "**内容**。只有类型、时间、退出码、限制值和 MCP 别名：不含 stderr、URL、命令行或环境变量。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:948
msgid ""
"**Where to look.** The browser service journals to `/run/agent-"
"browser/events.jsonl`, and each slot's runner to `/run/agent-mcp-"
"slots/<slot>/events.jsonl`. The sandbox manager reads them every minute "
"and holds the rows until a heartbeat answer says `incidents: "
"\"accepted\"`."
msgstr ""
"**到哪里查看**。浏览器服务把事件写入 `/run/agent-browser/events.jsonl`，每个槽位的 runner 写入 "
"`/run/agent-mcp-slots/<slot>/events.jsonl`。Sandbox Manager "
"每分钟读取一次，并一直保留这些行，直到某次心跳应答返回 `incidents: \"accepted\"`。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:954
msgid "Before a job can run for real"
msgstr "任务真正跑起来之前"

#: ../developer/operations.md:956
msgid ""
"Provision each host, check its network, enroll it and set up the "
"credentials before enabling job claims."
msgstr "启用任务认领之前，先准备好每台主机，检查其网络，完成注册并配置好凭据。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:959
msgid "0. The sandbox network needs its host rules, a resolver and its relay"
msgstr "0\\. 沙箱网络需要主机防火墙规则、一个 DNS 解析器及其中继"

#: ../developer/operations.md:961
msgid ""
"Every sandbox group runs on its own routable bridge, the same for setup, "
"the agent and each Fork sibling. This deployment's host nftables tables "
"decide what it reaches: public IPv4 on TCP 80/443, the resolver in "
"`AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER`, the group's relays (MCP, plus the model and "
"GitHub relays where configured) and the SSH servers its owner enabled, "
"and nothing else. There is no mode to choose and no setting that opens it"
" further. [The sandbox network](#the-sandbox-network) has the full rule "
"set and what each refusal means."
msgstr ""
"每个沙箱组都运行在自己的可路由网桥上，安装脚本、agent 和每个 Fork 兄弟成员共用这一个网桥。本部署在主机上的 nftables "
"表决定它能访问什么：TCP 80/443 上的公网 IPv4、`AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER` "
"中的解析器、该组的中继（MCP，以及在已配置时的模型中继和 GitHub 中继），以及其所有者启用的 SSH "
"服务器，除此之外一概不行。没有可选的模式，也没有能进一步放开的设置。[沙箱网络](#the-sandbox-"
"network)一节给出完整的规则以及每种拒绝的含义。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:969
msgid "Before it can run a job, a host needs:"
msgstr "主机在运行任务之前需要："

#: ../developer/operations.md:971
msgid ""
"`AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL` and `AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER`. Neither "
"has a default: the pool must be this deployment's own, and the resolver "
"is the only DNS a sandbox can use."
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL` 和 "
"`AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER`。两者都没有默认值：地址池必须是这个部署独有的，而解析器是沙箱唯一能用的 DNS。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:974
msgid ""
"The MCP relay on the relay network, `AGENT_RELAY_NETWORK` (the host "
"compose derives `<COMPOSE_PROJECT>-agent-relays`), declared `internal: "
"true`. No sandbox group joins it: lifecycle code finds the MCP tunnel "
"there by alias and attaches it to each group's bridge, and refuses the "
"group network before the Agent CLI starts if the alias has no running "
"container, or more than one. Let Compose create this network; one created"
" by hand is refused because its labels do not match."
msgstr ""
"中继网络 `AGENT_RELAY_NETWORK` 上的 MCP 中继（主机 compose 推导为 `<COMPOSE_PROJECT"
">-agent-relays`），该网络声明为 `internal: true`。沙箱组不会加入它：生命周期代码在其中按别名找到 MCP "
"隧道，并把它接入每个组的网桥；如果该别名没有正在运行的容器，或者不止一个，就在 Agent CLI 启动前拒绝创建组网络。让 Compose "
"创建这个网络；手动创建的同名网络会因为标签不符而被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:981
msgid "A kernel with nftables, bridge family included."
msgstr "支持 nftables（包括 bridge 族）的内核。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:982
msgid ""
"Docker 28 or newer, client and daemon. The relay joins each group bridge "
"with gateway priority -1, so that a group bridge never becomes its "
"default route (`freeinference-chat-net-*` sorts before "
"`<COMPOSE_PROJECT>_internal`). At the default priority, the relay's SSH "
"session would meet the sandbox rules and die for every group sharing it."
msgstr ""
"Docker 28 或更新版本，客户端和守护进程都要满足。中继以网关优先级 -1 加入每个组的网桥，这样组网桥永远不会成为它的默认路由"
"（`freeinference-chat-net-*` 的排序在 `<COMPOSE_PROJECT>_internal` "
"之前）。如果用默认优先级，中继的 SSH 会话会撞上沙箱规则而断开，共用它的每个组都会受影响。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:988
msgid "Checks run at four points:"
msgstr "检查发生在四个时间点："

#: ../developer/operations.md:990
msgid ""
"`sandbox_host.sh prepare` validates the network settings with the "
"candidate runner image's parser before draining any runner."
msgstr "`sandbox_host.sh prepare` 在排空任何 runner 之前，用候选 runner 镜像中的解析器校验网络设置。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:992
msgid ""
"`sandbox_host.sh check` requires HTTP 200 from MCP `/healthz`, sent from "
"containers on the relay network, before publishing the ready marker. Name"
" resolution alone does not prove that the tunnel's upstream is up."
msgstr ""
"`sandbox_host.sh check` 在发布就绪标记之前，要求从中继网络上的容器访问 MCP `/healthz` 得到 HTTP "
"200。仅能解析名称并不说明隧道的上游可用。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:995
msgid ""
"Each runner's preflight installs and reads back the host tables before it"
" claims anything."
msgstr "每个 runner 的预检在认领任何任务之前，都会安装并回读主机上的规则表。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:997
msgid ""
"Each group cold start checks inside the guest, as the sandbox user, for a"
" default route, the configured resolver and the relay's TCP port. A "
"failure stops the sandbox, keeps its workspace and fails the turn."
msgstr "每次组冷启动时，都会以沙箱用户身份在客户机内部检查默认路由、所配置的解析器和中继的 TCP 端口。检查失败会停止沙箱、保留其工作区，并让该轮失败。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1001
msgid ""
"For a runner on another machine, the MCP relay is an SSH tunnel to the "
"MCP-only listener; see [Running runners on another machine](#running-"
"runners-on-another-machine)."
msgstr ""
"对于另一台机器上的 runner，MCP 中继是一条通往仅 MCP 监听进程的 SSH 隧道；见[在另一台机器上运行 runner"
"](#running-runners-on-another-machine)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1004
msgid ""
"Lifecycle code creates the `freeinference-chat-net-*` group networks "
"through the Docker API: one `/29` from the pool each, named from the "
"group and generation, with host interfaces named from this deployment's "
"prefix. A group's bridge is deleted on an idle or lost stop, while the "
"container's writable layer stays, and is recreated on wake. Sandbox "
"Manager reconciliation removes labelled bridges left by an interrupted "
"create after a five-minute grace period. A bridge that an environment "
"test or prebuild still uses is removed by that run; one that "
"reconciliation cannot remove, such as one with an unknown container "
"attached, is logged as `chat_network_prune_failed` and retried on the "
"next pass."
msgstr ""
"生命周期代码通过 Docker API 创建 `freeinference-chat-net-*` 组网络：每个网络从地址池中分配一个 "
"`/29`，按组和代次命名，主机侧接口名带有本部署的前缀。组在空闲或丢失时停止，其网桥随之删除，容器的可写层保留，唤醒时再重新创建网桥。Sandbox"
" Manager "
"的对账会在五分钟宽限期之后删除创建中途被打断而遗留的带标签网桥。环境测试或预构建仍在使用的网桥由该次运行自己删除；对账无法删除的网桥（例如接有未知容器）会记录为"
" `chat_network_prune_failed`，在下一轮再试。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1014
msgid "1. Only enrolled sandbox hosts run jobs"
msgstr "1\\. 只有已注册的沙箱主机才会运行任务"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1016
msgid ""
"Jobs run only on enrolled hosts. Deploy at least one host through "
"`deploy/host/deploy.sh` and enroll it; its runner then polls "
"`/v1/agent/worker/claim`, and claims nothing until its replica attests "
"the retained protocol, image and runtime pins, sandbox manager "
"configuration, execution profile and host capacity."
msgstr ""
"任务只在已注册的主机上运行。通过 `deploy/host/deploy.sh` 至少部署一台主机并完成注册；之后它的 runner 会轮询 "
"`/v1/agent/worker/claim`，但在其副本证明保留协议、镜像与运行时固定版本、Sandbox Manager "
"配置、执行配置和主机容量之前，不会认领任何任务。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1022
msgid ""
"**Admin → Servers → Add server** writes the host's `.env` ([Compute "
"resources](operations-compute.md)), and you write none of it by hand. "
"Besides the enrollment credential, it holds `COMPOSE_PROJECT`, "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE`, `AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL` and "
"`AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER` (each interpolated with `:?` in `docker-"
"compose.sandbox.yml`, so an unset one stops the render), "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN`, the two tunnel destinations with their own"
" keys and known-hosts files, and the three sandbox manager reverse-"
"forward settings."
msgstr ""
"**Admin → Servers → Add server** 会写好主机的 `.env`（[计算资源](operations-"
"compute.md)），你不需要手写其中任何内容。除注册凭据外，它还包含 "
"`COMPOSE_PROJECT`、`AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE`、`AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL` "
"和 `AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER`（它们在 `docker-compose.sandbox.yml` 中都用 `:?` "
"插值，任何一个未设置都会让渲染中止）、`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN`、两条隧道的目标及各自的密钥和 known-"
"hosts 文件，以及三项 Sandbox Manager 反向转发设置。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1031
msgid "2. Credentials"
msgstr "2\\. 凭据"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1033
msgid "**Host credential.** Mint a short-lived enrollment token for a named host:"
msgstr "**主机凭据**。为一台指定名称的主机签发一个短期有效的注册令牌："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1040
msgid ""
"Put it in `AGENT_ENROLL_TOKEN` for the first start. Registration replaces"
" it with a long-lived credential bound to that host, stored under "
"`AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT`, which every heartbeat and claim then uses. A "
"host name in a request is never identity by itself."
msgstr ""
"首次启动时把它放进 `AGENT_ENROLL_TOKEN`。注册会把它换成绑定该主机的长期凭据，保存在 "
"`AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT` 下，此后每次心跳和认领都用它认证。请求中的主机名本身永远不能作为身份。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1045
msgid ""
"**Sandbox manager credential.** One `AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN` per "
"environment, with the same value on the control plane and every host's "
"Sandbox Manager. A new installation generates it, and server setup writes"
" it into the hosts it sets up. It authorizes file, terminal, Git and "
"session-lifecycle calls, is not a claim credential, and never enters a "
"chat container."
msgstr ""
"**Sandbox Manager 凭据**。每个环境一个 `AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN`，控制平面和每台主机的 "
"Sandbox Manager 使用同一个值。全新安装会自动生成它，服务器配置流程会把它写入所配置的主机。它授权文件、终端、Git "
"和会话生命周期调用，不是认领凭据，也从不进入对话容器。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1051
msgid ""
"**GitHub credential.** Install a GitHub App and give the _control plane_ "
"its private key. The platform signs a nine-minute App JWT "
"(`github_app.py`; GitHub refuses more than ten) and exchanges it for an "
"hour-long installation token for the runner's clone credential, branch "
"lookups and repository reads, so nothing is minted or rotated by hand. "
"The key reaches the container through a read-only bind mount at a fixed "
"path, and two different variables are involved:"
msgstr ""
"**GitHub 凭据**。安装一个 GitHub App，并把它的私钥交给*控制平面*。平台签发九分钟有效的 App "
"JWT（`github_app.py`；GitHub 拒绝超过十分钟的 JWT），并换取一小时有效的安装令牌，供 runner "
"的克隆凭据、分支查询和仓库读取使用，因此不需要手动签发或轮换任何东西。私钥通过只读绑定挂载放在固定路径上，涉及两个不同的变量："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1067
msgid ""
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH`, the path **inside** the container, "
"defaults to that mount, so the Compose deployment sets only "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_FILE`. Put the file on the host, owned by "
"the service user, with `chmod 600`. Alternatively, save an inline PEM in "
"Admin Settings: it is encrypted and takes precedence over the mounted "
"file. A legacy `AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY` value is imported once."
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH` 是**容器内**的路径，默认就是那个挂载点，所以 Compose "
"部署只需设置 `AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_FILE`。把文件放在主机上，属主为服务用户，并执行 `chmod "
"600`。也可以在 Admin Settings 中保存内联的 PEM：它会被加密，并优先于挂载的文件。旧的 "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY` 值只会导入一次。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1074
msgid ""
"**The saved GitHub App ID decides whether GitHub is configured.** It is "
"imported once from `AGENT_GITHUB_APP_ID`. The key path always has a "
"default, and `/dev/null` is mounted there when there is no App. With the "
"App ID set, a key that cannot be loaded (missing, empty, unreadable or "
"invalid) does not stop the control plane (issue #47):"
msgstr ""
"**是否配置了 GitHub，由已保存的 GitHub App ID 决定**。它从 `AGENT_GITHUB_APP_ID` "
"导入一次。私钥路径总有默认值，没有 App 时那里挂载的是 `/dev/null`。设置了 App ID "
"后，无法加载的私钥（缺失、为空、不可读或无效）不会让控制平面停止（issue #47）："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1080
msgid ""
"Integrations and the composer say GitHub is temporarily unavailable. "
"Creating a job (temporary workspaces included), a runner's claim or a "
"branch lookup answers `503 source_control_unavailable` with `Retry-After:"
" 30`, and queued jobs and goal wakeups wait without spending retries."
msgstr ""
"Integrations 和输入框会提示 GitHub 暂时不可用。创建任务（包括临时工作区）、runner 认领或分支查询会返回 `503 "
"source_control_unavailable` 和 `Retry-After: 30`，排队的任务和目标唤醒会等待，不消耗重试次数。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1084
msgid ""
"The log has one `ERROR` event, `source_control_load_failed`, with a "
"`reason` (`key_file_unreadable`, `key_missing`, `key_invalid`, "
"`unexpected`) and, for a file, its path and the OS error. It repeats only"
" when the reason changes. Queued jobs that cannot start also fire the "
"`queue_not_starting` alert."
msgstr ""
"日志中会有一条 `ERROR` 事件 `source_control_load_failed`，带有 "
"`reason`（`key_file_unreadable`、`key_missing`、`key_invalid`、`unexpected`），如果是文件，还会给出路径和操作系统错误。只有原因变化时才会再次记录。排队的任务无法启动时，还会触发"
" `queue_not_starting` 告警。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1088
msgid ""
"The key is read again every 30 seconds, so fixing the file in place "
"recovers within a minute (`source_control_load_recovered`). Changing the "
"host path of the bind mount needs the container recreated."
msgstr ""
"私钥每 30 "
"秒重新读取一次，所以原地修好文件后一分钟内即可恢复（`source_control_load_recovered`）。修改绑定挂载在主机上的路径则需要重新创建容器。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1092
msgid ""
"**App permissions.** Checkout, pushes and pull requests need `contents: "
"write` and `pull_requests: write`; an owner's user token holds only what "
"both the App and the owner may do. Without `workflows`, GitHub refuses a "
"push that changes a file under `.github/workflows/`. For **Create "
"repository** in the pickers, also grant **Repository creation: write**; "
"GitHub also accepts the broader **Administration: Read and write** (see "
"GitHub's [repository creation "
"permissions](https://docs.github.com/en/rest/authentication/permissions-"
"required-for-github-apps#repository-permissions-for-repository-"
"creation)). Owners of existing installations may have to approve the new "
"permission, and without it repository creation reports that the App "
"cannot create repositories. Creation calls `POST /user/repos` with the "
"user's own token, in their personal account, private, with a README. It "
"adds no local grant, so on an installation limited to selected "
"repositories, the owner grants access through **Configure repository "
"access**. To revoke everything, uninstall the App."
msgstr ""
"**App 权限**。检出、推送和拉取请求需要 `contents: write` 和 `pull_requests: "
"write`；所有者的用户令牌只拥有 App 和所有者都具备的权限。没有 `workflows` 权限时，GitHub 会拒绝修改 "
"`.github/workflows/` 下文件的推送。要在选择器中使用 **Create repository**，还需授予 "
"**Repository creation: write**；GitHub 也接受范围更大的 **Administration: Read and"
" write**（见 GitHub "
"的[仓库创建权限](https://docs.github.com/en/rest/authentication/permissions-"
"required-for-github-apps#repository-permissions-for-repository-"
"creation)）。已有安装的所有者可能需要批准新增的权限，没有这项权限时，创建仓库会提示 App 无法创建仓库。创建会用用户自己的令牌调用 "
"`POST /user/repos`，在其个人账号下创建私有仓库并初始化 "
"README。它不会添加本地授权，因此如果安装只覆盖选定的仓库，所有者需要通过 **Configure repository access** "
"授予访问权限。要撤销全部访问，卸载 App 即可。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1106
msgid ""
"**Connect flow.** For users to authorize their own repositories, the App "
"also needs its OAuth half:"
msgstr "**连接流程**。要让用户授权自己的仓库，App 还需要配置 OAuth 部分："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1117
msgid ""
"Set the App's Callback URL to the **agent web's own origin**, where the "
"callback page and session cookie live. The authorize link sends no "
"`redirect_uri`, so GitHub uses the App's first Callback URL. Move it "
"whenever the web origin moves: a stale callback breaks the connect flow "
"without any error from GitHub. The Connect link is built from "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_CLIENT_ID` and GitHub's OAuth endpoint, and "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_INSTALL_URL` (`/apps/<slug>/installations/new`) is "
"offered after connecting and behind **Configure repositories**. Keep the "
"two separate: GitHub sends an installed App's install link to its "
"settings page without calling the callback, and an install URL pointing "
"at the OAuth endpoint loops a user with no installation through "
"authorization."
msgstr ""
"把 App 的 Callback URL 设为 **agent Web 自己的源**，回调页面和会话 Cookie 都在那里。授权链接不发送 "
"`redirect_uri`，所以 GitHub 使用 App 的第一个 Callback URL。Web "
"源变化时要同步修改它：过期的回调会让连接流程失败，而 GitHub 不会报任何错误。Connect 链接由 "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_CLIENT_ID` 和 GitHub 的 OAuth "
"端点构成，`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_INSTALL_URL`（`/apps/<slug>/installations/new`）则在连接之后以及"
" **Configure repositories** 中提供。两者要分开：GitHub 会把已安装 App "
"的安装链接带到它的设置页面，而不调用回调；如果把安装 URL 指向 OAuth 端点，没有安装的用户会在授权流程里来回打转。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1128
msgid ""
"The runner's clone token is a separate installation token, requested as "
"`contents: read` on the one repository being worked on, so checkout does "
"not inherit the App's broader permissions."
msgstr "runner 的克隆令牌是另一个安装令牌，只申请当前处理的那个仓库上的 `contents: read`，因此检出不会继承 App 更大的权限。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1132
msgid "The GitHub relay"
msgstr "GitHub 中继"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1134
msgid ""
"No GitHub token reaches a sandbox. Each member's residency carries a "
"placeholder (`agh.`) that git and `gh` present to GitHub, and commits "
"name the owner as author (`GIT_AUTHOR_*`, from the owner's noreply "
"address) with `AGENT_GITHUB_COAUTHOR` as co-author. Every group bridge "
"resolves `github.com` and `api.github.com` to the host's `github-tunnel`,"
" so every process in the sandbox reaches the relay. Before the first "
"process starts, a root exec writes the deployment's relay CA, and a "
"bundle of the image's roots plus the CA, to `/etc/freeinference/`, root-"
"owned and read-only. The tunnel forwards TLS unopened to the control "
"plane's GitHub relay, a listener of its own that holds the certificate."
msgstr ""
"沙箱里拿不到任何 GitHub 令牌。每个成员的 residency 带有一个占位符（`agh.`），git 和 `gh` 把它提交给 "
"GitHub；提交的作者是所有者（`GIT_AUTHOR_*`，取自所有者的 noreply "
"地址），`AGENT_GITHUB_COAUTHOR` 为共同作者。每个组网桥都把 `github.com` 和 `api.github.com`"
" 解析到主机的 `github-tunnel`，所以沙箱中的每个进程都会到达中继。在第一个进程启动之前，一个 root exec 会把部署的中继 "
"CA，以及镜像根证书加上该 CA 的证书包，写入 `/etc/freeinference/`，属主为 root 且只读。隧道把 TLS "
"原样转发给控制平面的 GitHub 中继，后者是一个独立的监听进程，持有证书。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1145
msgid ""
"The relay accepts the placeholder only while its residency serves a "
"running, leased, unstopped turn on an enrolled host. It then sends the "
"request with the owner's GitHub App user token when the request concerns "
"the conversation's repository and is on the relay's allowlist, and with "
"no credential otherwise. It refuses repository administration, secrets, "
"GraphQL, branch deletion and tags. A pull request it sees created is "
"recorded for the conversation. The control plane renews the owner's "
"token, so a long turn does not outlive it."
msgstr ""
"只有当 residency "
"正在为已注册主机上一个持有租约、未被停止的运行中轮次服务时，中继才接受该占位符。请求涉及对话的仓库并在中继的允许列表上时，中继附上所有者的 "
"GitHub App "
"用户令牌发送；否则不附带任何凭据。它拒绝仓库管理、secrets、GraphQL、删除分支和标签操作。它看到创建的拉取请求会记录在该对话下。控制平面会续期所有者的令牌，所以长时间的轮次也不会超过令牌的有效期。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1153
msgid "To turn it on:"
msgstr "启用步骤："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1155
msgid ""
"Run `deploy/control-plane/github-relay-certs.sh <dir>`. Keep `ca.key` "
"offline; give `relay.pem` and `relay.key` to the control plane "
"(`AGENT_GITHUB_RELAY_TLS_DIR`) and `ca.pem` to every host "
"(`AGENT_SANDBOX_GITHUB_RELAY_CA_FILE`)."
msgstr ""
"运行 `deploy/control-plane/github-relay-certs.sh <dir>`。`ca.key` 离线保存；把 "
"`relay.pem` 和 `relay.key` 交给控制平面（`AGENT_GITHUB_RELAY_TLS_DIR`），把 `ca.pem`"
" 交给每台主机（`AGENT_SANDBOX_GITHUB_RELAY_CA_FILE`）。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1159
msgid ""
"Give `relay.key` to the relay's user. The `github-relay` container runs "
"as uid 10001 and reads the directory through a read-only bind mount, "
"which keeps host ownership, so a key the operator owns at `0600` fails "
"with `PermissionError`. Run the script as root, which sets the key to "
"`10001:10001` and `0400`, or run `sudo chown 10001:10001 <dir>/relay.key`"
" as the script prints. Move `ca.key` out of `<dir>` before you mount it."
msgstr ""
"把 `relay.key` 交给中继的用户。`github-relay` 容器以 uid 10001 运行，通过只读 bind mount "
"读取这个目录，而 bind mount 保留宿主机上的属主，所以运维者自己持有、权限为 `0600` 的密钥会报 "
"`PermissionError`。以 root 运行脚本（它会把密钥设为 `10001:10001`、`0400`），或者按脚本提示运行 "
"`sudo chown 10001:10001 <dir>/relay.key`。挂载 `<dir>` 之前，把 `ca.key` 移出这个目录。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1165
msgid ""
"Enable the `github-relay` Compose profile on the control plane and on "
"each host, and give each host's `github-tunnel` its own SSH key, limited "
"by `permitopen` to the relay's port (`AGENT_GITHUB_TUNNEL_*`)."
msgstr ""
"在控制平面和每台主机上启用 `github-relay` Compose profile，并给每台主机的 `github-tunnel` "
"配一把它自己的 SSH 密钥，用 `permitopen` 限定只能访问中继的端口（`AGENT_GITHUB_TUNNEL_*`）。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1168
msgid "Set `AGENT_GITHUB_COAUTHOR` to the App bot's noreply address."
msgstr "把 `AGENT_GITHUB_COAUTHOR` 设为 App bot 的 noreply 地址。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1170
msgid ""
"Nothing on the platform scans what goes through the relay; branch "
"protection, GitHub's push protection and the repository's CI still apply "
"([design](../agents/specs/2026-11-04-agent-native-pull-requests.zh-"
"CN.md))."
msgstr ""
"平台不会扫描经过中继的内容；分支保护、GitHub 的推送保护和仓库的 CI "
"仍然生效（[设计](../agents/specs/2026-11-04-agent-native-pull-requests.zh-"
"CN.md)）。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1174
msgid ""
"Without an App, the runner clones anonymously, which works for public "
"repositories only. Without the App and the relay, agents cannot push or "
"open pull requests: jobs still run, and their changes stay in the "
"retained workspace, readable in the Git pane or as a download. There is "
"no static-token fallback (`AGENT_GITHUB_TOKEN` is not read), and a host "
"without the relay gives the sandbox no placeholder. The workspace is a "
"shallow checkout of the pinned commit and its parent, with the base "
"branch as a local branch at that commit, so a review can diff without "
"fetching."
msgstr ""
"没有 App 时，runner 以匿名方式克隆，只适用于公开仓库。没有 App 和中继时，agent "
"无法推送或创建拉取请求：任务照常运行，改动留在保留工作区中，可以在 Git 面板查看或下载。没有静态令牌作为后备（不会读取 "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_TOKEN`），没有中继的主机也不会给沙箱提供占位符。工作区是固定提交及其父提交的浅克隆，基础分支是指向该提交的本地分支，所以审查时无需抓取就能比较差异。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1183
msgid "Running self-hosted"
msgstr "自行部署运行"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1185
msgid ""
"Administrators can also attach an SSH server or provision a CloudLab "
"experiment from **Admin → Servers**, and select the ready host as the "
"location for new sandboxes ([compute-resource runbook](operations-"
"compute.md)). Retained sandboxes stay on their original host, and neither"
" Remove nor Forget destroys the machine."
msgstr ""
"管理员也可以在 **Admin → Servers** 中接入一台 SSH 服务器或申请一个 CloudLab "
"实验，并把就绪的主机选为新沙箱的位置（[计算资源运维手册](operations-"
"compute.md)）。已有的保留沙箱留在原来的主机上，Remove 和 Forget 都不会销毁机器。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1190
msgid ""
"Run the host agent as a **standing service**, so queued jobs are claimed "
"after crashes and reboots. **Add server** writes the host's `.env` and "
"runs the commands below for you; installing a host from a hand-written "
"`.env` is not supported, and this section is for operating a host that "
"exists. Its `.env` holds the enrollment token and the shared sandbox "
"manager token. The example below includes the shared-kernel setting for "
"trusted internal repositories; untrusted repositories need the default "
"`kata` backend and [Kata provisioning](#provisioning-kata-on-a-runner-"
"host)."
msgstr ""
"把主机 agent 作为**常驻服务**运行，这样崩溃和重启之后排队的任务仍能被认领。**Add server** 会写好主机的 `.env` "
"并替你执行下面的命令；不支持用手写的 `.env` 安装主机，本节针对的是运维已有的主机。它的 `.env` 包含注册令牌和共享的 Sandbox"
" Manager 令牌。下面的示例包含面向受信任内部仓库的共享内核设置；不受信任的仓库需要默认的 `kata` 后端和 [Kata 准备"
"](#provisioning-kata-on-a-runner-host)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1205
msgid ""
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_BACKEND=container` is an **explicit downgrade**: sandbox "
"groups share the host kernel. Compose uses `restart: unless-stopped`, so "
"enable the host's Docker daemon at boot. The host lifecycle commands are:"
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_BACKEND=container` 是一种**明确的降级**：沙箱组共享主机内核。Compose 使用 "
"`restart: unless-stopped`，所以要让主机的 Docker 守护进程开机自启。主机生命周期命令如下："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1222
msgid ""
"Use the standalone host stack even on the control plane's machine, with "
"tunnel destinations pointing to its local listeners. `preflight` checks "
"Docker, the retained-session configuration, host isolation and the "
"configured image, and `up` repeats those checks for the image it deploys."
msgstr ""
"即使在控制平面所在的机器上，也使用独立的主机服务组，并把隧道目标指向本机的监听进程。`preflight` 检查 "
"Docker、保留会话配置、主机隔离和所配置的镜像，`up` 会针对它部署的镜像重复这些检查。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1227
msgid "Host configuration reference"
msgstr "主机配置参考"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1229
msgid ""
"`sandbox_host.sh` validates the required environment before starting and "
"prints the runner's preflight verdict: control plane reachable, retained "
"image and runtime usable, Docker data root correct, relay network present"
" and route-less, host network rules installed and read back. The "
"equivalent by hand:"
msgstr ""
