" 数据根目录正确、中继网络存在且没有路由、主机网络规则已安装并回读。手动执行的等价命令："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1247
msgid ""
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE` has no default: the runner and the Sandbox Manager "
"both interpolate it with `:?`. Tag it per environment (`…-job:staging`, "
"`…-job:prod`) so a rebuild on one side cannot replace the other's image. "
"All hosts share one queue (`claim_job` uses `FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED`), "
"with no leader and no sharding."
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE` 没有默认值：runner 和 Sandbox Manager 都用 `:?` "
"插值它。按环境给镜像打标签（`…-job:staging`、`…-job:prod`），这样一边重新构建不会替换另一边的镜像。所有主机共享一个队列（`claim_job`"
" 使用 `FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED`），没有主节点，也不分片。"

