" revoked best-effort on disconnect. GitLab support covers identity and "
"discovery only: the control plane verifies the GitLab user and lists "
"their projects, but GitLab projects do not appear in the task composer, "
"and it neither reads their source nor opens merge requests."
msgstr ""
